01:05:00.900 --> 01:05:06.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: During my first term as Congresswoman in 2019, may lista po si Listahanan.

asr-001267
01:05:06.440 --> 01:05:12.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Unfortunately, in March 17, 2020, nagkaroon ng lockdown because of COVID pandemic.

asr-001268
01:05:12.660 --> 01:05:13.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Hindi na tapos.

asr-001269
01:05:13.100 --> 01:05:19.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So yung una naming reaksyon is we want Sustainable Livelihood Program of DSWD.

asr-001270
01:05:19.740 --> 01:05:22.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We list down 230 members.

asr-001271
01:05:23.600 --> 01:05:32.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Nagka problema na nawala na ng trabaho or yung mga negosyo nila, nagka problema na.

asr-001272
01:05:32.240 --> 01:05:35.300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: In short, we list down 230 beneficiaries.

asr-001273
01:05:35.900 --> 01:05:47.020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Nung chineck po ng DSWD sa Listahanan, of the 223, yung qualified lang po are 157 that time.

asr-001274
01:05:47.020 --> 01:05:51.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, nagkaroon ng more than 70 na mga beneficiary na hindi na qualified.

asr-001275
01:05:52.440 --> 01:05:53.020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, no?

asr-001276
01:05:53.600 --> 01:06:01.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Dahil ang basis nila 2019, nagka problema kami doon sa bigayan ng cash assistance for SLP.

asr-001277
01:06:02.040 --> 01:06:04.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, there were like 70 na hindi qualified.

asr-001278
01:06:04.880 --> 01:06:11.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, yun po yung problema natin, Mr. Secretary, kung meron kayong safety nets na i-base nyo on the situation,

asr-001279
01:06:12.340 --> 01:06:17.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: like for example, sa nangyari ng 2019 and 2021 na listahanan.

asr-001280
01:06:17.980 --> 01:06:22.060
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, una ho, biro lang 'yon. Love na love namin yung RD niya.

asr-001281
01:06:22.440 --> 01:06:22.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And we don't...

asr-001282
01:06:23.600 --> 01:06:26.480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: There's no violence in the department. We like RD Tolits.

asr-001283
01:06:27.280 --> 01:06:32.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, isa-isahin ko. Loaded ho kasi yung question, but allow me to expound further.

asr-001284
01:06:32.680 --> 01:06:35.900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Una ko, listahanan was the main database of the government.

asr-001285
01:06:36.200 --> 01:06:41.180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But because of the law, the CBMS law that this house and the upper house passed, wala nang listahanan.

asr-001286
01:06:42.460 --> 01:06:45.860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Unfortunately, listahanan na nire-refer nyo, just pabalik tanaw ko lang,

asr-001287
01:06:45.860 --> 01:06:49.940
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: nung dumating rin ako, it was a chaotic listahanan, not because the department was at fault,

asr-001288
01:06:50.360 --> 01:06:53.580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: but because hindi natapos yung survey ng listahanan because COVID.

asr-001289
01:06:53.600 --> 01:06:58.160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So they launched a listahanan because it was required from us to do so,

asr-001290
01:06:58.260 --> 01:07:02.300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: or else wala tayong database kahit na hindi siya fully natapos dahil sa COVID.

asr-001291
01:07:02.720 --> 01:07:03.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Unforeseen circumstance.

asr-001292
01:07:04.440 --> 01:07:07.960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But that's behind us because wala nang listahanan. Bawal na ho yun.

asr-001293
01:07:08.360 --> 01:07:10.940
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: No government agency can craft a new database.

asr-001294
01:07:11.480 --> 01:07:14.660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ayon sa batas, lahat kami ang gagamitin na namin CBMS.

asr-001295
01:07:15.080 --> 01:07:18.760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So ma'am, the first question, kami ang in-charge sa implementation,

asr-001296
01:07:18.760 --> 01:07:23.580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: but the targeting in the list comes from PSA using CBMS.

asr-001297
01:07:23.600 --> 01:07:26.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: DepDev at PSA, anak ho nila 'yon.

asr-001298
01:07:26.100 --> 01:07:32.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Number two, not that I am going to, not that I am lawyering for PSA,

asr-001299
01:07:32.100 --> 01:07:36.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: but ma'am, alam rin po natin from our own experience, there is no perfect list.

asr-001300
01:07:36.600 --> 01:07:42.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Merong 20 to 30% na exclusion, inclusion error.

asr-001301
01:07:42.600 --> 01:07:48.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero unfortunately, from the ground, tama ho kayo, Mr. Chair, tama ang ating buting congresswoman,

asr-001302
01:07:48.600 --> 01:07:53.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: etong CBMS na to, medyo napakalaki ng exclusion at inclusion.

asr-001303
01:07:53.600 --> 01:07:54.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Napakalaki.

asr-001304
01:07:54.600 --> 01:08:00.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya nga ho, kung matatandaan nyo, lagi ho kami tinatanong, ba't ayaw namin gawing automated yung payout.

asr-001305
01:08:00.600 --> 01:08:03.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Dahil nga, we need to do the validation on the ground.

asr-001306
01:08:03.100 --> 01:08:09.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: As the good Congresswoman pointed out, DSWD is tasked to safeguard the money that we have,

asr-001307
01:08:09.600 --> 01:08:11.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na makarating yon sa nangangailangan.

asr-001308
01:08:11.600 --> 01:08:13.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi dun sa hindi nangangailangan.

asr-001309
01:08:13.600 --> 01:08:19.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So ang nangyayari, tama ho si Congresswoman, pagbigay ho sa amin ang CBMS list, we validate it.

asr-001310
01:08:19.600 --> 01:08:21.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: That's why nagmamanual ho kami.

asr-001311
01:08:21.600 --> 01:08:23.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Dahil sa manual process namin nakikita,

asr-001312
01:08:23.600 --> 01:08:25.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: totoong tao pa ba to?

asr-001313
01:08:25.600 --> 01:08:26.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Buhay pa ba siya?

asr-001314
01:08:26.600 --> 01:08:27.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nandun pa ba siya?

asr-001315
01:08:27.600 --> 01:08:29.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Gumanda na ba yung buhay?

asr-001316
01:08:29.600 --> 01:08:31.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi remember, CBMS was done 2024.

asr-001317
01:08:31.600 --> 01:08:33.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're now doing 2026.

asr-001318
01:08:33.600 --> 01:08:35.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: May iba diyan, gumanda na yung buhay.

asr-001319
01:08:35.600 --> 01:08:39.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nakapag-abroad at nagkaroon ng negosyo.

asr-001320
01:08:39.600 --> 01:08:41.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So that's my answer.

asr-001321
01:08:41.600 --> 01:08:45.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The short and easy of it, unfortunately, we have taken this up with PSA and NEDA,

asr-001322
01:08:45.600 --> 01:08:49.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and they promised to tighten the next CBMS round next year.

asr-001323
01:08:49.600 --> 01:08:51.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kausap lang namin sila kahapon.

asr-001324
01:08:51.600 --> 01:08:52.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi sinasabi nga namin,

asr-001325
01:08:52.600 --> 01:08:56.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na nahihirapan kami dun sa listahan kasi kami ang sinasabugan.

asr-001326
01:08:56.600 --> 01:08:58.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kami lagi ang pinuputukan.

asr-001327
01:08:58.600 --> 01:09:00.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Akala ng tao, nagdadamot kami,

asr-001328
01:09:00.600 --> 01:09:03.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: or akala ng tao, mali yung targeting namin.

asr-001329
01:09:03.600 --> 01:09:06.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kung listahanan yan, by all means, we would accept it.

asr-001330
01:09:06.600 --> 01:09:08.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero hindi kasi kami ang nagtarget neto.

asr-001331
01:09:08.600 --> 01:09:10.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But to the same degree, Mr. Chair,

asr-001332
01:09:10.600 --> 01:09:12.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I come from the ranks of the local government unit.

asr-001333
01:09:12.600 --> 01:09:18.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Our LGUs are also tasked to work closely with the PSA in rolling out the CBMS.

asr-001334
01:09:18.600 --> 01:09:21.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So next year, meron tayong bagong CBMS.

asr-001335
01:09:21.600 --> 01:09:24.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hopefully, maggamot na tong mga issues na to.

asr-001336
01:09:24.600 --> 01:09:26.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Another case in point, Mr. Chairman,

asr-001337
01:09:26.600 --> 01:09:30.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: we've also fixed the SLP issue that plagued that program.

asr-001338
01:09:30.600 --> 01:09:34.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya nga, kung titignan nyo, ngayon, mas mabilis kami gumamit ng SLP.

asr-001339
01:09:34.600 --> 01:09:39.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Because nga, one, we are no longer saying na yun na lang, yung listahan na lang.

asr-001340
01:09:39.600 --> 01:09:43.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: When we joined the department, we scrapped the hole na dapat sa listahanan kinukuha.

asr-001341
01:09:43.600 --> 01:09:46.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We do the field or manual validation on the ground.

asr-001342
01:09:46.600 --> 01:09:50.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya nga, bottom line, lagi kami tinatarong bakit nagbamanual kami.

asr-001343
01:09:50.600 --> 01:09:54.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi dahil trip lang hoon namin or dahil gusto namin pahirapan ng tao.

asr-001344
01:09:54.600 --> 01:10:03.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kundi 'yon lang ang only means namin in trying to make sure na yung pera ng taong-bayan ay napupunta sa tamang benepisyaryo.

asr-001345
01:10:03.600 --> 01:10:05.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001346
01:10:05.600 --> 01:10:12.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's different talaga pag nag-local, nag-congress ka din.

asr-001347
01:10:12.600 --> 01:10:15.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So you're really the right man for this job.

asr-001348
01:10:15.600 --> 01:10:19.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And if I were to ask you, sa tingin mo ba lahat ng

asr-001349
01:10:19.600 --> 01:10:25.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: CBMS na listahan po ngayon ay hindi tama?

asr-001350
01:10:25.600 --> 01:10:32.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi sa nakikita ko, based in my district, sa Iloilo City especially, mga 27% ang difference.

asr-001351
01:10:32.600 --> 01:10:38.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So sayang pa rin yung 27% na katao na pwede sana mag-avail ng programa.

asr-001352
01:10:38.600 --> 01:10:40.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So let's take it as a national perspective.

asr-001353
01:10:40.600 --> 01:10:45.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Tama ba yung CBMS na resulta nila based sa 2027?

asr-001354
01:10:45.600 --> 01:10:49.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Because when I asked my collaboration meeting with the region,

asr-001355
01:10:49.600 --> 01:10:57.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ang sabi nila we did ask for the support of the barangay officials sa ganitong pag-gather ng data ng CBMS.

asr-001356
01:10:57.600 --> 01:11:06.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, and I've said this so many times, nung pinatawag ho kami ng special committee ni Chairman Quimbo,

asr-001357
01:11:06.600 --> 01:11:10.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sinabi na rin namin na nahihirapan kami dun sa CBMS.

asr-001358
01:11:10.600 --> 01:11:13.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Napakalaki ng inclusion at exclusion.

asr-001359
01:11:13.600 --> 01:11:15.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I think it's more than 30%.

asr-001360
01:11:15.600 --> 01:11:17.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tansya namin sa sarili namin.

asr-001361
01:11:17.600 --> 01:11:18.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Close to 40%.

asr-001362
01:11:18.600 --> 01:11:20.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Close to 40%.

asr-001363
01:11:20.600 --> 01:11:21.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Why?

asr-001364
01:11:21.600 --> 01:11:26.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang average uplift na uptake ngayon is only at 60% or 55%.

asr-001365
01:11:26.600 --> 01:11:28.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Meaning maraming nawawala.

asr-001366
01:11:28.600 --> 01:11:30.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mas malaki ho sa 35%.

asr-001367
01:11:30.600 --> 01:11:35.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So we raised the alarm already and we told the dep-dev about this.

asr-001368
01:11:35.600 --> 01:11:42.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I personally spoke to Secretary Balisacan and they made a promise to tighten also the implementation of CBMS next year.

asr-001369
01:11:42.600 --> 01:11:44.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yesterday I was with Usec Mapa. I don't mean

asr-001370
01:11:44.600 --> 01:11:46.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I don't mean to speak ill of them.

asr-001371
01:11:46.600 --> 01:11:53.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: what I've already said before in this House, as well as what I told them numerous times na nagpunta po ako.

asr-001372
01:11:53.600 --> 01:11:54.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you, good secretary.

asr-001373
01:11:54.600 --> 01:11:56.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I know you'll be there to be on top of everything.

asr-001374
01:11:56.600 --> 01:12:04.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So again, Mr. Chair, before I end, can you allow me to show a little, like 30 minutes—30 seconds of my video?

asr-001375
01:12:04.600 --> 01:12:13.290
Presentation video: [unclear] nagkaroon ng biglaang krisis sa buhay. Ang layon ng programa ng DSWD na AICS.

asr-001376
01:12:13.290 --> 01:12:16.290
Presentation video: Pag-uwi ng mga benepisyaryo, [unclear] ang mga benepisyaryo

asr-001377
01:12:16.290 --> 01:12:19.290
Presentation video: na kunin yung porsyento ng payout. Sa ₱10,000

asr-001378
01:12:19.290 --> 01:12:26.290
Presentation video: na ibinigay sa kanilang tulong pinansyal, pilit kunin yung ₱8,000 hanggang ₱9,000.

asr-001379
01:12:26.290 --> 01:12:31.290
Presentation video: Sa Iloilo City, inireklamo naman ang pangungupit daw sa ipinamahaging

asr-001380
01:12:31.290 --> 01:12:36.290
Presentation video: ayuda mula sa ₱10,000 na dapat matanggap ng mga benepisyaryo.

asr-001381
01:12:36.290 --> 01:12:41.290
Presentation video: The DSWD investigation must be transparent.

asr-001382
01:12:41.290 --> 01:12:43.290
Presentation video: Names, barangays involved,

asr-001383
01:12:43.290 --> 01:12:45.290
Presentation video: the exact amount deducted, and the findings

asr-001384
01:12:45.290 --> 01:12:48.290
Presentation video: of the legal team must be made public.

asr-001385
01:13:05.980 --> 01:13:08.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: With that, Mr. Secretary, thank you for heeding our call.

asr-001386
01:13:08.640 --> 01:13:14.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I know hindi lang ito nangyayari sa district ko, but sa buong Pilipinas.

asr-001387
01:13:14.640 --> 01:13:19.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: With your leadership, lahat ng may kasalanan dapat managot.

asr-001388
01:13:19.640 --> 01:13:23.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Truly, maasahan ang Bagong Pilipinas.

asr-001389
01:13:23.640 --> 01:13:27.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Salamat, Mr. Secretary. Congratulations, DSWD.

asr-001390
01:13:31.900 --> 01:13:35.080
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you so much, Cong Jam.

asr-001391
01:13:35.080 --> 01:13:41.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Chair, I just wanted you to know that nag-file na po si Secretary ng case,

asr-001392
01:13:41.080 --> 01:13:48.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: and I was informed na may mga officials na po na natanggal ng Ombudsman.

asr-001393
01:13:48.080 --> 01:13:52.080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And we are waiting for the final list of that po.

asr-001394
01:13:52.080 --> 01:13:54.080
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you.

asr-001395
01:13:59.980 --> 01:14:05.200
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Before we move on, we'd like to acknowledge additional members who just came in.

