Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Assistant Majority Leader De Carlo

asr-001403
01:14:27.680 --> 01:14:30.680
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Uy. Representative Adrian Amatong.

asr-001404
01:14:30.680 --> 01:14:35.680
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Vice Chair Maria Cristina Talavera-Lopez.

asr-001405
