Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Representative Girlie Veloso.

asr-001406
01:14:37.680 --> 01:14:41.680
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Representative Elijah San Fernando.

asr-001407
01:14:41.680 --> 01:14:43.680
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Vice Chair Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-001408
01:14:43.680 --> 01:14:45.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Good morning, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001409
01:14:45.680 --> 01:14:46.680
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Good morning.

asr-001410
01:14:46.680 --> 01:14:49.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Good morning, Secretary Rex and the family of DSWD.

asr-001411
01:14:49.680 --> 01:14:51.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Good morning to all.

