Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Jose

asr-001414
01:15:00.440 --> 01:15:01.670
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: "Bong" Teves Jr.

asr-001415
01:15:04.120 --> 01:15:11.950
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: We also like to acknowledge Representative Jay Vergara and Vice Chair Bernadette Barbers.

asr-001416
01:15:11.960 --> 01:15:23.310
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you. So we move on and we recognize from the minority Representative Dadah Kiram Ismula.

asr-001417
01:15:24.420 --> 01:15:40.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair. Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh. Magandang umaga po sa aking former family, sa DSWD family po. Mr. Chair, meron lamang akong konting katanungan.

asr-001418
01:15:40.480 --> 01:16:05.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Magsisimula po ako tungkol sa Uplift at informal workers. Nitong dumaan tayo sa malubhang economic crisis dala ng US-Iran conflict, nakita natin maraming jeepney drivers, market vendors, at iba pang informal workers ang umasa sa ayuda mula sa gobyerno dito sa programang Uplift.

asr-001419
01:16:05.540 --> 01:16:13.950
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pero maraming nabigo at naiyak dahil pagdating sa payout, hindi pala sila kasali.

asr-001420
01:16:13.950 --> 01:16:17.630
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary,

asr-001421
01:16:17.630 --> 01:16:24.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: gusto po sana nilang malaman, ano po kaya ang nangyari, bakit karamihan sa kanila ay hindi nakasama sa master list ng ahensya?

asr-001422
01:16:26.940 --> 01:16:30.220
