DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Technology Bureau. And at the same time, hopefully, padating na rin,

asr-001807
01:30:18.640 --> 01:30:21.960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sabi sa akin ni Sec Kim, yung sa AICS program natin ng mga manggagawa.

asr-001808
01:30:21.960 --> 01:30:29.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ganda ng mga sagot ni Sec. Ibig sabihin po, Mr. Chair, it is a continuing regularization process po?

asr-001809
01:30:29.240 --> 01:30:31.880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Correct. At may progress po. Hindi ho laway lamang, kundi

asr-001810
01:30:31.880 --> 01:30:36.880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: limang libo. Marami ho, and I think that's the first time na ganyang

asr-001811
01:30:36.880 --> 01:30:41.320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: karami yung nare-regularize. Hinahanda na rin yung second batch na 5,000.

asr-001812
01:30:41.950 --> 01:30:45.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Wow. Sige po. Dadako naman po ako sa ibang katanungan.

asr-001813
01:30:45.160 --> 01:30:50.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Psychosocial support po. Ang DSWD ay merong program na tinatawag

asr-001814
01:30:50.540 --> 01:30:56.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na Wireless Mental Health and Psychosocial Support, or WeSupport. This

asr-001815
01:30:56.340 --> 01:30:57.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: DSWD

asr-001816
01:30:57.380 --> 01:31:02.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: initiative aims to establish a systematic response in addressing mental

asr-001817
01:31:02.380 --> 01:31:07.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: health and psychosocial concerns through wireless and online platforms.

asr-001818
01:31:07.480 --> 01:31:13.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilan po ang total users ng WeSupport platform sa nakaraang taon, at ano ang

asr-001819
01:31:13.520 --> 01:31:18.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: breakdown per age group? Kung sakaling wala pong data right now,

asr-001820
01:31:18.020 --> 01:31:23.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: puwede naman pong i-submit sa committee. Kasama po doon yung isa sa katanungan ko rin na

asr-001821
01:31:23.660 --> 01:31:27.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ano-anong mga coverage ng WeSupport program

asr-001822
01:31:27.380 --> 01:31:29.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa kabataan at estudyante?

asr-001823
01:31:29.380 --> 01:31:34.500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, the WeSupport program is a smaller program of the

asr-001824
01:31:34.500 --> 01:31:39.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: department. 681 ang naging beneficiaries. Sounds really small, but we've already

asr-001825
01:31:39.920 --> 01:31:44.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pivoted under the Social Technology Bureau, a new program patterned after our

asr-001826
01:31:44.380 --> 01:31:49.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: cash-for-work tutoring program, yung Tara Basa. Ngayon meron ho kaming Tara Usap.

asr-001827
01:31:49.380 --> 01:31:53.980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: It's a peer-to-peer support group in colleges and universities that we are

asr-001828
01:31:53.980 --> 01:31:57.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: now piloting everywhere. Ang naging partner po namin doon is the

asr-001829
01:31:57.380 --> 01:32:01.260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ateneo School of Psychology, as well as the UP School of Psychology, kung saan

asr-001830
01:32:01.260 --> 01:32:06.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: we're establishing safe spaces in schools. It's like Alcoholics Anonymous abroad.

asr-001831
01:32:06.440 --> 01:32:19.320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: At kina-capacitate natin yung mga peer counselors, pero obviously klaro rin sa kanila yung hangganan ng kanilang kayang gawin and the referral pathways. So that's something that we're proud

asr-001832
01:32:19.320 --> 01:32:24.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: of, that we're already innovating. We veered towards peer-to-peer kasi we

asr-001833
01:32:24.000 --> 01:32:27.280
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: always believe in community approaches kung saan we

asr-001834
01:32:27.280 --> 01:32:30.340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: empower the community to take care of the community.

asr-001835
01:32:30.340 --> 01:32:37.610
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May monitoring system po kayo para makita yung effectiveness sa pagbawas ng stress, anxiety, depression?

asr-001836
01:32:37.610 --> 01:32:40.480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Dahil pilot pa lang ho ito, bahagi naman ho 'yon ng design. But we

asr-001837
01:32:40.480 --> 01:32:44.320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: will gladly report back to the committee after the pilot run is over.

asr-001838
01:32:44.320 --> 01:32:49.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Para po sa huling katanungan, given the recent school shootings na nagpapakita

asr-001839
01:32:49.920 --> 01:32:56.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng vulnerability sa ating mga kabataan, ano po ang kongkretong plano ng DSWD

asr-001840
01:32:56.000 --> 01:33:02.110
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para palakasin ang long-term psychosocial support ng WeSupport para sa mga kabataan?

asr-001841
01:33:02.110 --> 01:33:04.080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam, Mr. Chair, we're veering away not

asr-001842
01:33:04.080 --> 01:33:07.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: just from WeSupport. Kami, we've been working with the Masayang Pamilyang

asr-001843
01:33:07.920 --> 01:33:11.760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: organisasyon, yung Masayang Pamilyang Pilipino organization

asr-001844
01:33:11.760 --> 01:33:15.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: for the longest time. These are people from the academe,

asr-001845
01:33:15.920 --> 01:33:19.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: most notably si Professor Alampay, who is one of the more senior

asr-001846
01:33:19.600 --> 01:33:24.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: academe members of the Ateneo School of Psychology. Kami naniniwala, patatagin natin yung pamilya.

asr-001847
01:33:24.920 --> 01:33:28.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So we've revamped the 4Ps Family Development Sessions to strengthen

asr-001848
01:33:28.700 --> 01:33:44.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: the role of our parents in making sure na alam nila ano yung mga red flags. Kasi it starts at home. Tama, malaki ang gampanin ng mga guro, pero pag kausap namin ang mga guro, nagsisimula yung formative years sa bahay.

asr-001849
01:33:44.380 --> 01:33:47.520
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So that's why we're looking at it from a paradigm of a parent

asr-001850
01:33:47.520 --> 01:33:52.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: or a family intervention. So una po 'yon, binago na ho natin yung 18 years na

asr-001851
01:33:52.000 --> 01:33:55.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: curriculum ng FDS, ng Family Development Sessions, to

asr-001852
01:33:55.840 --> 01:34:00.080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: incorporate newer newer topics like digital uh

asr-001853
01:34:00.080 --> 01:34:04.880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: digital literacy but in the same case uh digital awareness or digital parenting

asr-001854
01:34:04.880 --> 01:34:09.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: These are new modules. Number two, yung batas ho na Parent Effectiveness

asr-001855
01:34:09.120 --> 01:34:13.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and simula namin roll out and these this one is being done

asr-001856
01:34:13.440 --> 01:34:17.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: together with edu child another known family oriented

asr-001857
01:34:17.360 --> 01:34:22.620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: local group that does capacity building for our parents. At the end of the day,

asr-001858
01:34:22.620 --> 01:34:24.460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: yung long-term ho, we do the

asr-001859
01:34:24.460 --> 01:34:27.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sana huwag na maulit, but we do the post kung

asr-001860
01:34:27.840 --> 01:34:33.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: may nangyayari. Working with the academe, we have trauma-informed care already na beyond

asr-001861
01:34:33.120 --> 01:34:35.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: disasters, pati mga ganitong insidente.

asr-001862
01:34:35.840 --> 01:34:39.200
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero kami, ang approach pa rin namin, strengthening the Filipino families,

asr-001863
01:34:39.200 --> 01:34:44.190
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: strengthening our parents' capabilities so that they can watch over their children at home.

asr-001864
01:34:44.190 --> 01:34:45.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-001865
01:34:45.840 --> 01:34:49.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Just a short manifestation dahil wala na po akong time.

asr-001866
01:34:49.920 --> 01:34:55.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, nais kong i-highlight na lang ang mental health support ay may direct

asr-001867
01:34:55.520 --> 01:35:00.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: impact sa safety, learning at overall well-being ng kabataan.

asr-001868
01:35:00.080 --> 01:35:04.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya mahalaga na palakasin ang programang ito bilang preventive at

asr-001869
01:35:04.720 --> 01:35:08.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: accessible support system para sa ating mga kabataan,

asr-001870
01:35:08.320 --> 01:35:13.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: gaya ng WeSupport. Also, Mr. Chair, napansin ko po na bumaba po yung

asr-001871
01:35:13.840 --> 01:35:19.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pondo sa ating Supplemental Feeding Program na mula sa ₱9.56

asr-001872
01:35:19.520 --> 01:35:25.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: bilyon nitong taon, naging ₱6.35 billion na lamang po sa NEP ng

asr-001873
01:35:25.520 --> 01:35:34.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 2027. At dahil po doon, in the proper time, I will move to increase the budget of the DSWD for fiscal year 2027.

asr-001874
01:35:35.580 --> 01:35:45.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi po dapat tinatapyas ang ahensya na inaasahan ng mga marginalized sectors at vulnerable constituents ng ating bansa.

asr-001875
01:35:45.660 --> 01:35:46.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-001876
01:35:46.920 --> 01:35:47.260
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you.

asr-001877
01:35:47.260 --> 01:35:47.760
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you.

