Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: lalo na mga walang capital.

asr-001894
01:36:44.340 --> 01:36:50.400
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: secretary gusto ko lang itanong. Narinig ko kasi medyo nabawasan yata yung budget niyo sa SLP.

asr-001895
01:36:51.780 --> 01:36:52.860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ah yes Mr. Chair,

asr-001896
01:36:52.860 --> 01:36:56.880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: it's one of these line item na binanggit namin at sumulat rin kami sa committee

asr-001897
01:36:57.000 --> 01:36:57.160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na sana

asr-001898
01:36:57.160 --> 01:37:02.760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: maibalik at least man lang, ma-augment by a billion pesos. Mr. Chair, that is correct. Congressman

asr-001899
01:37:02.760 --> 01:37:09.960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Amatong is correct. Yung SLP, we're very happy na maraming mga partners natin ang tinatanong

asr-001900
01:37:09.960 --> 01:37:15.080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na SLP. That means nandoon na tayo sa mindset of teaching our people how to fish. We've actually

asr-001901
01:37:15.080 --> 01:37:20.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: submitted a one-billion-peso fund augmentation sana for the supplemental, sorry, for

asr-001902
01:37:20.600 --> 01:37:28.150
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: the Sustainable Livelihood Program. Kasi nga, that's part of our mandate, social development, hindi lang puro social welfare.

asr-001903
01:37:29.070 --> 01:37:32.760
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Mr. Chair, I'd like to support yung move na i-increase yung budget specifically

asr-001904
01:37:32.760 --> 01:37:38.520
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: sa SLP kasi na-experience namin. Ako kasi minsan ngayon yung payout, ayokong pumunta sa mga

asr-001905
01:37:38.520 --> 01:37:45.640
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: dole-outs kasi parang, although natutulungan naman yung local economy, pero

asr-001906
01:37:45.640 --> 01:37:51.560
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: siyempre pagkatapos noon wala na eh. Pero yung SLP kasi ang laking promise, kasi nga sabi ni Secretary,

asr-001907
01:37:51.560 --> 01:37:54.760
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: we teach our people how to fish. Hindi lang yung bibigyan ng isda.

asr-001908
01:37:55.320 --> 01:37:56.120
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: So, Mr.

asr-001909
01:37:56.200 --> 01:38:00.440
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Chair, gusto ko lang i-support yung move na yun na i-increase talaga yung budget,

asr-001910
01:38:00.440 --> 01:38:04.840
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kung pwede mas malaki pa sa one billion. Kasi dapat nandoon na tayo sa mode of

asr-001911
01:38:04.840 --> 01:38:12.040
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: enabling our people na makatayo sa sarili nila. Kasi kung lagi na lang nating

asr-001912
01:38:12.040 --> 01:38:17.000
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: binibigyan ng dole-outs, walang mangyayari. Lalaki nang lalaki yung utang natin dahil sa dole-outs natin.

asr-001913
01:38:17.560 --> 01:38:22.920
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Whereas ma-stimulate natin yung economy tapos mabigyan natin ng opportunity tumayo sa sarili nila.

asr-001914
01:38:22.920 --> 01:38:35.840
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Malamang hindi na hihingi ng dole-outs, kasi yun ang goal namin. I really commend your team doon sa Zamboanga del Norte, sa third district, kasi kahit weekends, kahit holidays, nagtatrabaho sila.

asr-001915
01:38:35.840 --> 01:38:41.020
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Kaya nagrereklamo din ako doon sa tinapyasan yung budget niyo for infrastructure,

asr-001916
01:38:41.020 --> 01:38:52.980
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kasi nakaikot na ako sa maraming opisina ng DSWD dito sa distrito ko. Kawawang-kawawa yung sitwasyon nila. Minsan isang kuwarto, siksikan sila parang sardinas. Pag kumilos

asr-001917
01:38:52.980 --> 01:38:53.980
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: yung isa, kikilos

asr-001918
01:38:53.980 --> 01:38:57.480
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: din yung iba sa dulo kasi nga siksikan na sila. Pati ang dami-daming

asr-001919
01:38:57.480 --> 01:39:06.010
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: mga files na nandoon. So, Secretary, nag-request din kayo para sa augmentation sa infra niyo?

asr-001920
