DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, for

asr-001921
01:39:09.040 --> 01:39:14.800
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: doon sa GASS na pondo na nawala rin. But I assure the good congressman, after

asr-001922
01:39:14.800 --> 01:39:18.340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: he raised the concern at nakita ko yung mga opisina sa kanilang lugar, that we've

asr-001923
01:39:18.340 --> 01:39:21.760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: already downloaded funds from the central office to repair those.

asr-001924
01:39:21.760 --> 01:39:27.760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Admittedly, the regional director who is behind me again should have raised

asr-001925
01:39:27.760 --> 01:39:31.820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: the red flag and told us na wala na siyang MOOE so that we could have downloaded. But

asr-001926
01:39:31.820 --> 01:39:34.960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: we've addressed that concern. Pero in the long run, part ho iyan ng hinihingi

asr-001927
01:39:34.960 --> 01:39:39.820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: naming augmentation sa general services na budget namin.

asr-001928
01:39:39.820 --> 01:39:43.420
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Mr. Chair, hindi lang ito sa distrito ko, kundi sa buong

asr-001929
01:39:43.420 --> 01:39:47.800
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Pilipinas. Why? Because hirap naman nating i-expect na nakangiti, kailangan

asr-001930
01:39:47.800 --> 01:39:51.700
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: nakangiti yung mga DSWD frontliners natin kasi nga

asr-001932
01:39:51.760 --> 01:39:56.920
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: hinaharap nila marami ring problema eh. Pero napakahirap namang i-expect na nakangiti sila

asr-001933
01:39:56.920 --> 01:40:00.640
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kung pag umuulan eh iiwas-iwas sila sa tubig, tapos

asr-001934
01:40:00.640 --> 01:40:05.520
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: kung napakainit and all. So para po matulungan naman ang mga taga-DSWD, mas

asr-001935
01:40:05.520 --> 01:40:10.060
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: maraming kababayan natin. Siguro kasi nagrereklamo din yung mga kliyente niyo

asr-001936
01:40:10.060 --> 01:40:14.120
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: pag pumupunta doon, minsan wala silang masilungan nang maayos. So,

asr-001937
01:40:14.120 --> 01:40:21.390
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Mr. Chair, I'd like to reiterate the need to help DSWD sa infra nila.

asr-001938
01:40:21.390 --> 01:40:26.580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, much appreciated. Pero let me just point out again.

asr-001939
01:40:26.580 --> 01:40:31.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Naka-embed sa mga budget, nakuwento ko nga ito kay Congressman, naka-embed sa mga

asr-001940
01:40:31.600 --> 01:40:35.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: budget ng mga region namin yung repairs and maintenance ng kanilang mga tanggapan.

asr-001941
01:40:35.920 --> 01:40:41.500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi naman ho zero yan eh. That's why the regional director in Region 9 got a

asr-001942
01:40:41.500 --> 01:40:45.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: tongue-lashing and will get more tongue-lashing after this, because hindi

asr-001943
01:40:45.640 --> 01:40:51.540
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: niya ginawa. It's in the initiative also of the regional director. But we

asr-001944
01:40:51.540 --> 01:40:55.020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: do appreciate the additional fund augmentation, of course, pero hindi naman

asr-001945
01:40:55.020 --> 01:40:58.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ho dapat umabot sa ganoon. Admittedly, yung pinakita niyo sa aking mga

asr-001946
01:40:58.360 --> 01:41:03.720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: litrato ng mga satellite office sa inyong distrito, hindi ho dapat umabot sa ganoon.

asr-001947
01:41:03.720 --> 01:41:09.600
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Pero Secretary, hindi yun yung intensyon ko. Intensyon ko ho naman po, support. Yes.

asr-001948
01:41:09.600 --> 01:41:16.960
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Tapos yun lang, Mr. Chair, yung number one concern ko lang talaga is SLP because nakita ko yung promise talaga nung

asr-001949
01:41:16.960 --> 01:41:20.660
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: program. In fact, si Governor Uy ng Zamboanga del Norte also recognizes

asr-001950
01:41:20.660 --> 01:41:21.540
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: the promise of

asr-001951
01:41:21.540 --> 01:41:28.400
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: SLP sa pagtulong lalo na sa mahihirap na mga probinsya. Alam ko yung sa mayayamang probinsya siguro hindi ganoon ka-significant yun.

asr-001952
01:41:28.820 --> 01:41:34.600
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: But for us, yung mga constituents natin na gusto nilang makahanap din ng paraan na makatayo sa sarili nila,

asr-001953
01:41:34.680 --> 01:41:41.000
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: na medyo may pride din sila, na gusto nilang umasenso sa sarili nilang pawis, malaking-malaking bagay yung SLP po.

asr-001954
01:41:41.100 --> 01:41:44.360
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Sana po yung pondo ng SLP ay madagdagan natin. Yun lang po.

asr-001955
01:41:44.660 --> 01:41:48.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Thank you again. I'd like to thank the good congressman for raising two very important things:

asr-001956
01:41:48.120 --> 01:41:52.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: augmentation for SLP and augmentation for repairs and maintenance or MOOE namin.

asr-001957
01:41:52.880 --> 01:41:55.300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Huwag ho kayong mag-alala, biro lang ho naman kanina yun.

asr-001958
01:41:56.760 --> 01:41:59.980
Rep. Adrian Michael A. Amatong: Yun lang po. Hindi ko naubos yung time ko. Marami pang magtatanong. Maraming salamat po.

asr-001959
01:42:00.720 --> 01:42:05.140
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you. The manifestation of Congressman Amatong is well noted.

asr-001960
01:42:05.720 --> 01:42:09.340
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: We move on with Representative Sara Elago.

asr-001961
01:42:11.200 --> 01:42:14.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair, at magandang araw sa lahat.

asr-001962
01:42:14.860 --> 01:42:17.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasama sa presentation ng DSWD,

asr-001963
01:42:17.200 --> 01:42:21.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang mga bagong programa tungkol sa Project SAFE,

asr-001964
01:42:21.040 --> 01:42:26.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nandiyan din ang enhanced na ProtecTEEN, hindi bago, pero mas napaunlad.

asr-001965
01:42:26.800 --> 01:42:32.630
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nandyan din ang programa natin para sa children with disabilities.

asr-001966
01:42:32.630 --> 01:42:35.110
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano ang pondo nito para sa susunod na taon?

asr-001967
01:42:40.980 --> 01:42:45.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, right now, itong mga programa na ito are good programs na this year,

asr-001968
01:42:45.360 --> 01:42:53.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nagkaroon ho ng tulong sa Kongreso at Senado na nakatanggap sila ng tig-25 million each.

asr-001969
01:42:53.760 --> 01:43:01.200
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero dahil sa NEP, inalis ho yun ulit, bumalik siya sa bare essentials na 50 million na paghahatian nilang tatlo.

asr-001970
01:43:01.200 --> 01:43:09.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero we also wrote the committee na baka puwede hong ibalik yung tig-25 million nila para mapalago natin itong mga programa na ito.

asr-001971
01:43:09.920 --> 01:43:17.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, ano-ano yung maapektuhan ng mga activities kung hindi mapupondohan ito para sa susunod na taon?

asr-001972
01:43:17.320 --> 01:43:20.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang proposal ng DSWD nasa 25 million level pa rin.

asr-001973
01:43:21.390 --> 01:43:23.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Obviously, Mr. Chair, we wanted more.

asr-001974
01:43:23.600 --> 01:43:28.480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero naunawaan na rin namin na may tight fiscal space.

asr-001975
01:43:28.480 --> 01:43:33.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So right now, hiningi na lang namin na sana mabalik lang sa 25 million kasi these are very good programs.

asr-001976
01:43:33.840 --> 01:43:36.560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang mga target beneficiaries nito...

asr-001982
01:43:45.000 --> 01:43:46.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yeah, the targets.

asr-001983
01:44:08.280 --> 01:44:15.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: For the ProtecTEEN program that takes care of our young mothers, to make sure that they don't give up on their dreams,

asr-001984
01:44:15.400 --> 01:44:17.300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and that their dignity is there,

asr-001985
01:44:17.320 --> 01:44:20.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and that they can pursue and become productive.

asr-001986
01:44:20.360 --> 01:44:28.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The total, the phase one of it is 415 young mothers for this year.

asr-001987
01:44:28.840 --> 01:44:37.800
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang maapektuhan siyempre kung hindi bumalik yan, yung 415 plus our projection sana na i-grow pa ito ng 841 nakaragdagang mga batang ina.

asr-001988
01:44:37.800 --> 01:44:41.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then sana sa year three, another 1,128.

asr-001989
01:44:41.400 --> 01:44:46.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So all these numbers will not happen if we don't get back the funding that we had.

asr-001990
01:44:46.440 --> 01:44:52.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Now for Project Aruga, ito naman yung tulong natin sa mga pamilya na may mga anak na espesyal na pangangailangan,

asr-001991
01:44:52.360 --> 01:44:57.960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ang tinitingnan natin na maaaring maapektuhan ay 3,390 households.

asr-001992
01:44:57.960 --> 01:45:00.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Now for Project SAFE,

asr-001993
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:09.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ito ho kasi, it's an advocacy program that protects us from OSAEC, or Online Sexual Abuse and Exploitation of Children, and trafficking.

asr-001994
01:45:09.880 --> 01:45:15.020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang total na maapektuhan will be 3,417.

asr-001995
01:45:16.140 --> 01:45:20.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, hindi dapat zero. Dapat ma-restore ang 25 million pesos.

asr-001996
01:45:20.920 --> 01:45:25.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung kaya pang dagdagan, dapat dagdagan para sa ProtecTEEN, Project SAFE at Project Aruga.

asr-001997
01:45:25.760 --> 01:45:31.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Mr. Chair, nabanggit kanina yung tungkol sa Haven for Women and Children.

asr-001998
01:45:31.040 --> 01:45:36.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung binanggit nyo po ba kaninang mga bilang para yun sa Haven for Women and Children na?

asr-001999
01:45:36.720 --> 01:45:37.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O magkahiwalay pa?

asr-002000
01:45:38.600 --> 01:45:42.650
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Women lang po ito. Women and children kasama.

asr-002001
01:45:42.960 --> 01:45:46.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nasaan?

asr-002001-split-2
01:45:46.800 --> 01:45:49.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, magkasabay po, women and children.

asr-002002
01:45:50.000 --> 01:45:53.980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: They're normally, yung mga binanggit po namin na numero 14 na DSWD Managed,

asr-002003
01:45:54.380 --> 01:45:55.740
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 45 na LGU,

asr-002004
01:45:55.760 --> 01:46:01.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and then 54 na private that we also watch over.

asr-002005
01:46:02.540 --> 01:46:06.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May bilang po ba kayo nung bilang ng mga victim survivors clients?

asr-002006
01:46:07.760 --> 01:46:09.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa pampubliko at pampribado?

asr-002007
01:46:25.930 --> 01:46:31.190
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, we'll furnish you a copy of the data being asked pag private at LGU ran.

asr-002008
01:46:31.310 --> 01:46:34.790
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: What we have yung sa DSWD, 5,833.

asr-002009
01:46:36.090 --> 01:46:37.090
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 5,833.

asr-002010
01:46:37.090 --> 01:46:40.090
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May na-identify ba kayo ng mga LGUs?

asr-002011
01:46:40.930 --> 01:46:47.050
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na kinakailangan pang magtayo ng mga bagong social welfare facility?

asr-002012
01:46:47.090 --> 01:46:49.150
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Meron po, Mr. Chair, and we'll gladly furnish you.

asr-002013
01:46:49.290 --> 01:46:52.130
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero ang naging direction na ho namin is a PPP scheme.

asr-002014
01:46:52.930 --> 01:46:57.490
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: If you can do PPP for healthcare, you can do PPP for social welfare and social protection.

asr-002015
01:46:58.170 --> 01:47:00.330
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi una po, para magtayo, we need land.

asr-002016
01:47:00.730 --> 01:47:02.310
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then pangalawa, may gestation period.

asr-002017
01:47:02.410 --> 01:47:06.030
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang construction time and all the permitting will take probably a year.

asr-002018
01:47:06.670 --> 01:47:10.530
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So mas mabilis po sana na i-augment na lang natin ulit yung nawala naming pondo

asr-002019
01:47:10.530 --> 01:47:13.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na in-allow na kami mag-cost of care na lang.

asr-002020
01:47:13.590 --> 01:47:17.630
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yung mga ina-credit na namin, bigyan na lang natin sila ng mga kliyente

asr-002021
01:47:17.630 --> 01:47:21.450
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi they do it very well anyway at bayaran na lang po natin yung cost of care.

asr-002022
01:47:21.870 --> 01:47:22.770
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mas mabilis po yun.

asr-002023
01:47:22.870 --> 01:47:28.890
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: There are spare capacities for every segment, for every type of vulnerable community in the private swadas.

asr-002024
01:47:30.330 --> 01:47:36.070
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, hintayin natin yung ulat tungkol doon sa na-ca-cater ng pampubliko at pampribado,

asr-002025
01:47:36.070 --> 01:47:40.290
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung magkano pa yung kinakailangan na pondo para ma-address.

asr-002026
01:47:40.290 --> 01:47:44.570
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung gap kung meron man sa mga lugar na nangangailangan ng mga shelters.

asr-002027
01:47:44.790 --> 01:47:52.410
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi marami pa rin talagang mga victim-survivors ng abuse ang mga nangailangan ng mga temporary shelters

asr-002028
01:47:52.410 --> 01:47:58.870
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para meron silang ligtas na espasyo para makapagpagaling at matulungan tungo sa recovery.

asr-002029
01:47:59.470 --> 01:48:04.850
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, nais kong magtanong sa Council for the Welfare of Children.

asr-002030
01:48:05.670 --> 01:48:08.790
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung mamarapatin ng ating Mr. Chair at ng Secretary.

asr-002031
01:48:09.450 --> 01:48:10.270
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Atungkol ho ito.

asr-002032
01:48:10.290 --> 01:48:14.410
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito sa implementation ng Juvenile Justice and Welfare Act.

asr-002033
01:48:15.190 --> 01:48:17.290
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ko ang status ng implementation ito?

asr-002034
01:48:17.370 --> 01:48:23.210
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, again, let me be the one to answer if I can for our attached agencies.

asr-002035
01:48:23.470 --> 01:48:30.590
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I will not be answering for NAPC, PCUP, and NCSC for the record because they're merely supervised agencies.

asr-002036
01:48:30.770 --> 01:48:32.110
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Their executive directors will do so.

asr-002037
01:48:32.750 --> 01:48:40.150
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, itong usapin na ito naging napakainit dahil nga sa mga state ng mga pangyayari na hindi natin lahat ginugusto.

asr-002038
01:48:40.290 --> 01:48:44.630
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: It's being implemented, pero there's room for improvement.

asr-002039
01:48:44.830 --> 01:48:46.350
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi pa siya fully na i-implement.

asr-002040
01:48:46.510 --> 01:48:50.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya nga pagdating sa panawagan para ibaba yung minimum age of criminal liability,

asr-002041
01:48:50.750 --> 01:48:54.850
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sinabi na namin for the record na hindi kami sang-ayon dahil hindi pa natin na fully implement.

asr-002042
01:48:55.290 --> 01:48:58.350
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Case in point, una po, kulang ho yung mga Bahay Pag-asa.

asr-002043
01:48:58.910 --> 01:49:03.370
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: These bahay pag-asas that were tasked na itayo sa mga highly urbanized cities at mga provinces,

asr-002044
01:49:03.930 --> 01:49:04.790
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: hindi pa ho natatayo.

asr-002045
01:49:05.410 --> 01:49:09.310
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Second, last year during the budget hearing, naluwabas na rin ho ito.

asr-002046
01:49:09.310 --> 01:49:13.690
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And that's why we innovated na kung hindi kaya ng mga lokal na pamalaan,

asr-002047
01:49:13.790 --> 01:49:15.790
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: magtayo tayo ng mga regional bahay pag-asa.

asr-002048
01:49:16.170 --> 01:49:18.310
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: You gave us a budget for five, a startup capital.

asr-002049
01:49:19.330 --> 01:49:21.390
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We are waiting for the SARO release.

asr-002050
01:49:21.930 --> 01:49:25.230
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero ready na ho kami to create those, to build those bahay pag-asa.

asr-002051
01:49:25.770 --> 01:49:27.810
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But again, baka sabihin nyo ang tagal.

asr-002052
01:49:28.510 --> 01:49:36.310
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The cost of care will also allow us to divert some of our clients to CICL private facilities.

asr-002053
01:49:37.430 --> 01:49:38.250
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Meron po niyan.

asr-002054
01:49:38.450 --> 01:49:39.250
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: In fact, they do it.

asr-002055
01:49:39.310 --> 01:49:45.150
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, unfortunately, the JJWA hasn't fully been implemented,

asr-002056
01:49:45.310 --> 01:49:48.650
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: lalong-lalo na pagdating doon sa aspeto na giving them a second chance.

asr-002057
01:49:49.090 --> 01:49:50.790
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The restorative justice part of it.

asr-002058
01:49:52.250 --> 01:49:56.070
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair, sa posisyon ng DSWD

asr-002059
01:49:56.070 --> 01:50:02.890
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na magkaroon ng buong-buo na implementation ng Juvenile Justice and Welfare Act.

asr-002060
01:50:03.290 --> 01:50:06.150
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Matugunan yung mga gaps, mabigyan ng mga pondo

asr-002061
01:50:06.150 --> 01:50:09.150
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang mga kinakailangan na facilities at services.

asr-002062
01:50:09.310 --> 01:50:18.310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At gayon din sa posisyon ng pagtutol sa pagpapababa ng minimum age of criminal responsibility.

asr-002063
01:50:18.590 --> 01:50:20.910
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na posisyon din ng representasyon na ito.

asr-002064
01:50:21.270 --> 01:50:25.090
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaugnay niyan, Mr. Chair, mahingi po tayo sa DSWD:

asr-002065
01:50:25.750 --> 01:50:32.630
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po yung mga priority doon sa mga gaps na dapat nating pondohan with urgency and necessity for the next year?

asr-002066
01:50:33.350 --> 01:50:34.150
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And then, next.

asr-002067
01:50:34.150 --> 01:50:38.790
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gusto ko pong magtanong in particular dito sa AgriCamp facility

asr-002068
01:50:39.310 --> 01:50:40.710
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na tinatayo sa Palawan.

asr-002069
01:50:41.530 --> 01:50:42.770
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natapos na po ba ito?

asr-002070
01:50:44.190 --> 01:50:49.830
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bakit po napili na lokasyon ang current location nito?

asr-002071
01:50:50.190 --> 01:50:51.710
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Una po, binigay po kasi yung lupa.

asr-002072
01:50:51.870 --> 01:50:54.230
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nandun yung Bucor na property, yung sa Iwahig.

asr-002073
01:50:54.810 --> 01:50:56.350
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Napakalaki po ng kanilang lote.

asr-002074
01:50:56.970 --> 01:50:58.910
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And di ba, kung matatandan po natin, Mr. Chair,

asr-002075
01:50:58.990 --> 01:51:02.410
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ang magmamanage naman ng AgriCamp sa batas ay yung Bucor.

asr-002076
01:51:02.730 --> 01:51:06.590
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, doon nilagay para malapit na sa kanilang existing operations

asr-002077
01:51:06.590 --> 01:51:08.450
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: at napakalawak ng kanilang lupa.

asr-002078
01:51:09.310 --> 01:51:14.230
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, binigay po nila yung parasela sa atin at ongoing po yung construction.

asr-002079
01:51:14.530 --> 01:51:17.770
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Admittedly, nagkaroon lang po kami ng konting hiccup na tigil ng konti.

asr-002080
01:51:17.950 --> 01:51:20.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero, we're now in the process of jump-starting again.

asr-002081
01:51:20.610 --> 01:51:21.330
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po yung mga hiccup?

asr-002082
01:51:21.690 --> 01:51:26.570
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Number one, meron pong mga informal settlers na kailangan namin siguraduhin

asr-002083
01:51:26.570 --> 01:51:30.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na ang kanilang mga karapatan ay hindi namin na va-violate

asr-002084
01:51:30.610 --> 01:51:32.990
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi meron pong nakatira doon sa property ng Bucor.

asr-002085
01:51:33.470 --> 01:51:37.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And pangalawa, we made sure rin na sumusunod kami sa mga environmental standards

asr-002086
01:51:37.610 --> 01:51:39.290
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na naka-prescribe.

asr-002087
01:51:39.310 --> 01:51:42.290
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Dahil alam naman natin, napaka-sensitive pagdating sa Palawan.

asr-002088
01:51:45.240 --> 01:51:48.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang, Mr. Chair, sa environmental standards.

asr-002089
01:51:48.400 --> 01:51:52.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero gusto ko hong matanong kung meron bang standards na naset

asr-002090
01:51:52.480 --> 01:51:59.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang DSWD, ang CWC, ang JJWC, pagdating doon sa mismong location.

asr-002091
01:52:00.620 --> 01:52:03.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang concern po natin, sinabi nyo naman po, hindi ito pinili,

asr-002092
01:52:03.880 --> 01:52:08.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kundi ibinigay at Bucor ang nag-identify

asr-002093
01:52:08.360 --> 01:52:11.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at hindi po DSWD at CWC.

asr-002094
01:52:11.480 --> 01:52:14.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang concern lang po namin, nabangkit nyo na rin yung proximity

asr-002095
01:52:14.760 --> 01:52:20.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: doon sa existing population sa iwahig prison and penal farm.

asr-002096
01:52:20.760 --> 01:52:24.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nababahala po kami na yung mismong location

asr-002097
01:52:24.860 --> 01:52:29.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay mas mataas na yung risk para sa stigma at discrimination

asr-002098
01:52:29.480 --> 01:52:32.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na maaaring maranasan ng mga convicted children

asr-002099
01:52:32.800 --> 01:52:37.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na mag-undertake ng rehabilitation doon sa area.

asr-002100
01:52:37.780 --> 01:52:39.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So yun po ang aming pangunahing concern.

asr-002101
01:52:39.440 --> 01:52:41.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya namin tinatanong kung meron ba,

asr-002102
01:52:41.460 --> 01:52:44.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: baka yung particular standards as regards choosing the location.

asr-002103
01:52:45.120 --> 01:52:48.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: First, let me just, again, baka hindi ko nalinaw na mabuti,

asr-002104
01:52:48.860 --> 01:52:51.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ang desisyon na yun ay joint decision ng DSWD,

asr-002105
01:52:51.460 --> 01:52:55.580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ng DOJ, BuCor, as well as nandoon ho yung JJWC.

asr-002106
01:52:55.980 --> 01:52:58.040
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Personally, ako nakapunta na ho ako doon sa property.

asr-002107
01:52:58.580 --> 01:53:00.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Una, maganda ho siya, kaaya-aya ho siya.

asr-002108
01:53:00.800 --> 01:53:03.820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The setting kasi of an agri-camp has to be an open expanse.

asr-002109
01:53:04.040 --> 01:53:06.560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi yun man ho natin siya pwede ilagay sa limit.

asr-002110
01:53:06.560 --> 01:53:09.280
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Okay, for the record, 50 years later,

asr-002111
01:53:09.740 --> 01:53:11.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: wala pa rin hong agri-camp ang bansa natin.

asr-002112
01:53:11.500 --> 01:53:15.500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So this is the first time, admittedly, na magtatayo na tayo ng AgriCamp.

asr-002113
01:53:15.600 --> 01:53:17.900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We've been violating that law over and over again.

asr-002114
01:53:18.380 --> 01:53:24.140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nakakatawa nga ho, nire-refer dapat ng mga judge sa mga agri-camp,

