DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na nalalagay sila sa mga pasilidad na hindi naman dapat na natatagpuan yung mga kabataan natin.

asr-002118
01:53:34.480 --> 01:53:36.260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So one, it was a joint decision.

asr-002119
01:53:36.260 --> 01:53:41.260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Two, let me assure you na yung dati naming undersecretary at yung current namin na undersecretary,

asr-002120
01:53:41.960 --> 01:53:43.460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na mga colleagues rin natin dito,

asr-002121
01:53:43.840 --> 01:53:46.060
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pinuntahan rin nila yun bago kami nag-sign off.

asr-002122
01:53:46.140 --> 01:53:50.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Si former undersecretary Villar and current undersecretary Dimaporo.

asr-002123
01:53:50.600 --> 01:53:52.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Lahat po yan, palahat kami pinuntahan namin.

asr-002124
01:53:52.980 --> 01:53:55.020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Maganda ho yung lugar, kaaya-aya.

asr-002125
01:53:55.500 --> 01:53:57.260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And ma'am, if I can give you the picture,

asr-002126
01:53:57.660 --> 01:53:59.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sobrang laki nung property ng Iwahig.

asr-002127
01:54:00.160 --> 01:54:02.480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Napakalayo rin niya kung nasaan yung main Iwahig.

asr-002128
01:54:03.060 --> 01:54:05.660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nasa peripheral siya, it's a mountainous area,

asr-002129
01:54:05.660 --> 01:54:07.620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: perfect for an agriculture setting.

asr-002130
01:54:08.100 --> 01:54:10.680
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So we assure you na meron ho kaming pag-aaral dyan.

asr-002131
01:54:11.460 --> 01:54:14.140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Standards naman, hindi ho yan lalagpas sa department,

asr-002132
01:54:14.320 --> 01:54:16.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: lalo na sa standards department namin,

asr-002133
01:54:16.400 --> 01:54:20.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: if the designs weren't meant to be restorative,

asr-002134
01:54:20.500 --> 01:54:24.280
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: rehabilitative, with a dream later on for reintegration.

asr-002135
01:54:26.120 --> 01:54:27.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat ho.

