asr-003151
02:18:46.610 --> 02:18:50.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At mayroon lang po ako, sekretary, katanungan

asr-003152
02:18:50.610 --> 02:18:52.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and I would like to hear from you

asr-003153
02:18:52.610 --> 02:18:55.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: para sa isang mga ating kalinawan.

asr-003154
02:18:56.610 --> 02:18:57.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Mr. Chair,

asr-003155
02:18:57.610 --> 02:19:00.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: sekretary, while shifting to e-wallets

asr-003156
02:19:00.610 --> 02:19:03.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and digital banks under initiatives like the

asr-003157
02:19:03.610 --> 02:19:05.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: banggit mo na kanina yung AFLI program

asr-003158
02:19:05.610 --> 02:19:07.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and PoorPeace is commendable,

asr-003159
02:19:07.610 --> 02:19:13.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: what percentage of DSWD's total payout volume

asr-003160
02:19:13.610 --> 02:19:16.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: across all social assistance programs

asr-003161
02:19:16.610 --> 02:19:20.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: is currently disbursed via fully digital channels

asr-003162
02:19:20.610 --> 02:19:24.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: versus manual cash in-hand payouts?

asr-003163
02:19:24.610 --> 02:19:25.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Atlat po ba?

asr-003164
02:19:25.610 --> 02:19:28.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ang mga programa nito ay patungo na po

asr-003165
02:19:28.610 --> 02:19:31.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: sa digitalization ng payout?

asr-003166
02:19:31.610 --> 02:19:33.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: May text ng text sa akin po kasi, sekretary,

asr-003167
02:19:33.610 --> 02:19:36.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: mga mahihirap nating questions sa Bulacan.

asr-003168
02:19:36.610 --> 02:19:40.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Paano daw natin masisiguro na ang mga binibisaryo natin

asr-003169
02:19:40.610 --> 02:19:43.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: na walang bangko, smartphone, o internet

asr-003170
02:19:43.610 --> 02:19:45.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: ay hindi mapag-iiwanan during payouts?

asr-003171
02:19:45.610 --> 02:19:46.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003172
02:19:46.610 --> 02:19:47.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: That's correct, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003173
02:19:47.610 --> 02:19:50.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: For different programs, iba-ibang strokes po.

asr-003174
02:19:50.610 --> 02:19:52.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Sa walang gutong program, it's fully digital

asr-003175
02:19:52.610 --> 02:19:54.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi from day one, digital na yun.

asr-003176
02:19:54.610 --> 02:19:56.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: For PoorPeace, ganun din ho.

asr-003177
02:19:56.610 --> 02:19:59.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero admittedly, doon sa social protection

asr-003178
02:19:59.610 --> 02:20:01.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: like AICS, which bahagi ang Uplift,

asr-003179
02:20:01.610 --> 02:20:04.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: we're still in the process of doing it.

asr-003180
02:20:04.610 --> 02:20:05.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Bakit po?

asr-003181
02:20:05.610 --> 02:20:07.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi tulad dito sa Uplift, natuklasan namin,

asr-003182
02:20:07.610 --> 02:20:09.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: katulad ng Pinoy in doubt nyo,

asr-003183
02:20:09.610 --> 02:20:12.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: napakaraming mahihirap nating kababayan ng unbanked.

asr-003184
02:20:12.610 --> 02:20:14.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Wala silang bank account.

asr-003185
02:20:14.610 --> 02:20:17.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So dito sa Uplift, ang goal ho sana namin

asr-003186
02:20:17.610 --> 02:20:22.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: that entire 2.5 million na Group 2, sana digital na.

asr-003187
02:20:22.610 --> 02:20:25.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero nung nag-payout ho kami for validation

asr-003188
02:20:25.610 --> 02:20:28.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para kunin yung kanila mga GCash account or ATM accounts,

asr-003189
02:20:28.610 --> 02:20:32.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: only 20% of them ang may mga bank account.

asr-003190
02:20:32.610 --> 02:20:37.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So we've been working with the BSP, Banko Sentral,

asr-003191
02:20:37.610 --> 02:20:43.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: si Deputy Governor Bernard Romulo Puyat

asr-003192
02:20:43.610 --> 02:20:46.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: to make sure na on this payout sa Uplift,

asr-003193
02:20:46.610 --> 02:20:48.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: nandun na yung mga banko at GCash.

asr-003194
02:20:48.610 --> 02:20:50.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're enrolling them already.

asr-003195
02:20:50.610 --> 02:20:53.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nahihirapan ho kami kasi gustuhin man namin

asr-003196
02:20:53.610 --> 02:20:54.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na mag-digital.

asr-003197
02:20:54.610 --> 02:20:55.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tulad na na-point out nyo,

asr-003198
02:20:55.610 --> 02:20:57.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: napakarami sa kanila ang walang banko

asr-003199
02:20:57.610 --> 02:20:59.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: at nanganganib na mapag-iwanan

asr-003200
02:20:59.610 --> 02:21:02.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kapagka pipilitin namin yung digital oramismo.

asr-003201
02:21:02.610 --> 02:21:03.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero sa mga darating na buwan,

asr-003202
02:21:03.610 --> 02:21:04.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: parami ng parami na ho,

asr-003203
02:21:04.610 --> 02:21:06.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 20% na yung may bank accounts.

asr-003204
02:21:06.610 --> 02:21:08.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So hopefully we can get more than that 20%

asr-003205
02:21:08.610 --> 02:21:11.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para maglipat na tayo sa digital format.

asr-003206
