Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: so last na lang po ito,

asr-003210
02:21:20.270 --> 02:21:21.270
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: regarding po doon sa

asr-003211
02:21:21.270 --> 02:21:24.270
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: launch of decentralized

asr-003212
