asr-003223
02:21:45.270 --> 02:21:46.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: thought of carefully.

asr-003224
02:21:46.270 --> 02:21:48.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're working with the

asr-003225
02:21:48.270 --> 02:21:50.270
