asr-003227
02:21:53.270 --> 02:21:55.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Meron tayong mga LGUs na nag-adapt na,

asr-003228
02:21:55.270 --> 02:21:56.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ready na sila.

asr-003229
02:21:56.270 --> 02:21:59.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero again, alam natin na masalimuot to

