asr-003235
02:22:10.270 --> 02:22:13.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero it doesn't mean na hindi tayo gagawa ng hakbang.

asr-003236
02:22:13.270 --> 02:22:15.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Patuloy tong programa na to,

asr-003237
02:22:15.270 --> 02:22:16.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pero tulad din sa inyo,

asr-003238
02:22:16.270 --> 02:22:18.270
