02:23:35.860 --> 02:23:40.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron po tayong presentation.

asr-003275
02:23:40.860 --> 02:23:41.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan.

asr-003276
02:23:41.860 --> 02:23:42.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-003277
02:23:42.860 --> 02:23:45.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ang unang mga tanong po natin ay

asr-003278
02:23:45.860 --> 02:23:48.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: mas may kinalaman sa national policy

asr-003279
02:23:48.860 --> 02:23:52.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: as expressed in the DSWD budget.

asr-003280
02:23:52.860 --> 02:23:55.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Specifically on poverty alleviation.

asr-003281
02:23:55.860 --> 02:23:57.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kinuha po natin yung datos

asr-003282
02:23:57.860 --> 02:24:01.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng mga tawagin nating core ayuda programs

asr-003283
02:24:01.860 --> 02:24:05.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng DSWD from 2016 to 2026.

asr-003284
02:24:05.860 --> 02:24:09.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos nandyan din yung proposed ng 2027.

asr-003285
02:24:09.860 --> 02:24:13.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kasama dyan, pinagsama-sama natin yung

asr-003286
02:24:13.860 --> 02:24:18.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa pantawid, 4Ps, AICS, at saka SLP,

asr-003287
02:24:18.860 --> 02:24:20.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: plus also some others,

asr-003288
02:24:20.860 --> 02:24:25.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung ayuda ACAP, yung food stamp program,

asr-003289
02:24:25.860 --> 02:24:27.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at saka yung LITAO.

asr-003290
02:24:27.860 --> 02:24:30.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero parang tawagin nating mas minor yung mga ngayon.

asr-003291
02:24:30.860 --> 02:24:33.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Anong nakita natin dito?

asr-003292
02:24:33.860 --> 02:24:35.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, una, yung paglaki.

asr-003293
02:24:35.860 --> 02:24:40.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Over a decade, 2016 to 2026.

asr-003294
02:24:40.860 --> 02:24:45.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Noong 2016, last year of the Aquino administration,

asr-003295
02:24:45.860 --> 02:24:49.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 73 billion yung total na ayuda sa ilalim ng DSWD.

asr-003296
02:24:49.860 --> 02:24:53.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2026 is na 184 billion.

asr-003297
02:24:53.860 --> 02:24:56.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos makikita nyo rin dun sa color coding

asr-003298
02:24:56.860 --> 02:25:00.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga share ng iba't ibang programa.

asr-003299
02:25:00.860 --> 02:25:03.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung blue, yun yung 4Ps.

asr-003300
02:25:03.860 --> 02:25:08.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung orange, yung AICS.

asr-003301
02:25:08.860 --> 02:25:11.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Lipat tayo.

asr-003302
02:25:11.860 --> 02:25:15.860
