DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero pahabaan na ng pahabaan listahan namin.

asr-006496
05:05:09.800 --> 05:05:11.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Baka hindi na talaga kami ma-entertain.

asr-006497
05:05:11.580 --> 05:05:14.240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi dagdag kami ng dagdag sa listahan.

asr-006498
05:05:14.340 --> 05:05:20.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But it's a good program because it empowers communities and it brings development into the far-flung areas.

asr-006499
05:05:20.120 --> 05:05:21.960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Maliit man yung proyekto, but meaningful.

asr-006500
05:05:22.140 --> 05:05:25.240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi katulad ng sinabi nyo, tulay na araw-araw ginagamit.

asr-006501
05:05:25.320 --> 05:05:27.320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Water system na araw-araw ginagamit.

asr-006502
05:05:28.540 --> 05:05:29.460
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Tama po, Mr. Chair.

asr-006503
05:05:29.960 --> 05:05:30.620
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: We'll see.

asr-006504
05:05:30.780 --> 05:05:35.860
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Maybe our appropriations may allocate additional budget for that.

asr-006505
05:05:36.200 --> 05:05:40.940
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: My next question, although actually it's been raised already several times by our fellow congressmen,

asr-006506
05:05:41.400 --> 05:05:43.700
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: so I think I would just manifest.

asr-006507
05:05:43.700 --> 05:05:51.200
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: The SLP program that you have established is really helping a lot of associations,

asr-006508
05:05:51.740 --> 05:05:54.360
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: not just in my district, but nationwide.

asr-006509
05:05:55.320 --> 05:06:09.540
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: And I hope our Committee on Appropriations may add, I heard that kulang po ng P1 billion, tama po, based on our request.

asr-006510
05:06:09.540 --> 05:06:13.940
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Our Vice Chairman of Appropriations is here.

asr-006511
05:06:13.940 --> 05:06:18.200
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Maybe we can prioritize ito pong SLP.

asr-006512
05:06:18.200 --> 05:06:24.540
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Karamihan po ng mga congressmen, naninig po natin, ito, much favored po nila talaga yung SLP program.

asr-006513
05:06:24.540 --> 05:06:31.220
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Because it not just empowers the communities, it really changes the lives of our constituents.

asr-006514
05:06:31.840 --> 05:06:36.360
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: So with that, I would like to end my manifestation.

asr-006515
05:06:37.460 --> 05:06:38.500
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Mr. Chair, yun lang po.

asr-006516
05:06:38.500 --> 05:06:44.240
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Baka pwede po natin tugunan yung pangailangan ng DSWD with regards to the SLP program.

asr-006517
05:06:44.420 --> 05:06:45.220
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006518
05:06:46.060 --> 05:06:47.180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

