Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you, Mr. Dino.

asr-006545
05:08:26.940 --> 05:08:29.940
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: We now recognize Cong. Garbin.

asr-006546
05:08:29.940 --> 05:08:32.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Thank you.

asr-006547
05:08:32.470 --> 05:08:33.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Thank you, Chair.

asr-006548
05:08:33.470 --> 05:08:35.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Magandang hapon po to the SEC.

asr-006549
05:08:35.470 --> 05:08:38.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Magandang hapon to the DSWD family.

asr-006550
05:08:38.470 --> 05:08:44.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: My question pertains to the implementation of Republic Act 9344.

asr-006551
05:08:44.470 --> 05:08:59.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Since the DSWD is at the center of implementing the diversion program through the Juvenile Justice Council,

asr-006552
05:09:00.470 --> 05:09:11.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: the recent event, one that happened in Tacloban, the other one in Zamboanga,

asr-006553
05:09:11.470 --> 05:09:20.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: discloses some of the loopholes and weaknesses of the existing law.

asr-006554
05:09:20.470 --> 05:09:27.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Some of the findings were the failure because of the,

asr-006555
05:09:27.470 --> 05:09:39.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: the functional, lack of functional well-budgeted establishment,

asr-006556
05:09:39.470 --> 05:09:55.080
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: especially referring to the Bahay Pag-asa that will manage the intervention program of these children in conflict with the law.

asr-006557
05:09:55.080 --> 05:10:01.110
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: May I inquire, Mr. Secretary, whether the proposed budget,

asr-006559
05:10:01.110 --> 05:10:08.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: for 2027 includes a budget for the establishment of Bahay Pag-asa in different localities,

asr-006560
05:10:08.470 --> 05:10:12.470
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: especially in big cities and urban areas?

asr-006561
05:10:12.470 --> 05:10:15.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: That's a very relevant and timely question.

asr-006562
05:10:15.470 --> 05:10:22.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: In the JJWA, the LGUs are the ones tasked to build and fund and operate the Bahay Pag-asas.

asr-006563
05:10:22.470 --> 05:10:25.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The DSWD's main role is to set the standards,

asr-006564
05:10:25.470 --> 05:10:29.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: to monitor the progress of the intervention programs.

asr-006565
05:10:29.470 --> 05:10:34.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero years later, we have given the data na highly urbanized cities don't have Bahay Pag-asas,

asr-006566
05:10:34.470 --> 05:10:36.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: a lot of the provinces do not.

asr-006567
05:10:36.470 --> 05:10:38.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya nga kanina nung tinanong ako,

asr-006568
05:10:38.470 --> 05:10:42.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: is it time to revisit the JJWA?

asr-006569
05:10:42.470 --> 05:10:48.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yes, in the sense na dapat natin lagyan ng provision for the national government to step in already,

asr-006570
05:10:48.470 --> 05:10:53.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: because hindi natin makita yung full fruition ng restorative justice kung wala hong mga Bahay Pag-asa na ito.

asr-006571
05:10:53.470 --> 05:10:54.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pangalawa,

asr-006572
05:10:55.470 --> 05:10:58.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: last year, because of the lack of Bahay Pag-asa,

asr-006573
05:10:58.470 --> 05:11:04.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: the Congress and the Senate gave us a new creature called the Regional Bahay Pag-asa.

asr-006574
05:11:04.470 --> 05:11:05.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Five.

asr-006575
05:11:05.470 --> 05:11:08.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're not fully funded, initially funded.

asr-006576
05:11:08.470 --> 05:11:11.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're still waiting for the SARO to be released,

asr-006577
05:11:11.470 --> 05:11:14.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pero we're constantly following up because naka-for-later-release siya.

asr-006578
05:11:14.470 --> 05:11:19.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But the authorities in DBM understand the magnitude na kailangan masimulan na ito.

asr-006579
05:11:19.470 --> 05:11:25.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But Mr. Chairman, let me point out na bagama't wala yang mga Bahay Pag-asa,

asr-006580
05:11:25.470 --> 05:11:30.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: meron pang isang provision na last year nilagay sa libro ng DSWD, or sa budget ng DSWD.

asr-006581
05:11:30.470 --> 05:11:38.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yun yung ability namin na mag-farm out ng services for private social welfare and development agencies,

asr-006582
05:11:38.470 --> 05:11:40.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi may mga private naman eh,

asr-006583
05:11:40.470 --> 05:11:43.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na pwede kami magbayad ng cost of care.

asr-006584
05:11:43.470 --> 05:11:48.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So inaantay na lang namin yung final go signal because the guidelines are being drafted already,

asr-006585
05:11:48.470 --> 05:11:50.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: together with DBM and COA.

asr-006586
05:11:50.470 --> 05:11:53.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Once we do that, we can now refer clients to

asr-006587
05:11:53.470 --> 05:11:58.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: existing private facilities that can rehabilitate

asr-006588
05:11:58.470 --> 05:12:02.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and hopefully reintegrate with the right intervention plan,

asr-006589
05:12:02.470 --> 05:12:04.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: our CICLs.

asr-006590
05:12:04.470 --> 05:12:07.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-006591
05:12:07.100 --> 05:12:13.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: I fully understand the situation of the SWD.

asr-006592
05:12:13.100 --> 05:12:18.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: But as you know, those referrals will only be very limited,

asr-006593
05:12:18.100 --> 05:12:24.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: especially if cases such as Samboanga Tacloban

asr-006594
05:12:24.100 --> 05:12:28.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: and cases that will happen in far-flung areas.

asr-006595
05:12:28.100 --> 05:12:33.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: And so before we speak of intervention and their version program

asr-006596
05:12:33.100 --> 05:12:37.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: that could be implemented by the council to be managed by DSWD,

asr-006597
05:12:37.100 --> 05:12:42.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: I hope that the national government will also have an intervention

asr-006598
05:12:42.100 --> 05:12:46.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: in giving funds to those localities that can,

asr-006599
05:12:46.100 --> 05:12:51.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: because not everyone can afford this Bahay Pag-asa.

asr-006600
05:12:51.100 --> 05:12:53.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: And I hope that this,

asr-006601
05:12:54.100 --> 05:12:59.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: intervention by the national government in coming up with those funds

asr-006602
05:12:59.100 --> 05:13:02.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: to be allocated for those local government units

asr-006603
05:13:02.100 --> 05:13:05.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: and that can maintain this Bahay Pag-asa.

asr-006604
05:13:05.100 --> 05:13:07.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: My second question is,

asr-006605
05:13:07.100 --> 05:13:12.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: considering that there were so many proposals

asr-006606
05:13:12.100 --> 05:13:17.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: in lowering the age of criminal responsibility,

asr-006607
05:13:17.100 --> 05:13:23.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: what is your take on this several proposals?

asr-006608
05:13:23.100 --> 05:13:28.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Well, some are saying that the innocence that we are protecting

asr-006609
05:13:28.100 --> 05:13:36.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: 20 years ago when we adopt and approve this law,

asr-006610
05:13:36.100 --> 05:13:38.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Republic Act 9344,

asr-006611
05:13:38.100 --> 05:13:45.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: is no longer existing in this present time,

asr-006612
05:13:45.100 --> 05:13:47.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: considering that, you know,

asr-006613
05:13:47.100 --> 05:13:50.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: minors right now, their maturity comes early

asr-006614
05:13:50.100 --> 05:13:52.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: because of their exposure

asr-006615
05:13:52.100 --> 05:13:55.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: to social media and they become more exposed,

asr-006616
05:13:55.100 --> 05:13:58.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: more informed and more daring.

asr-006617
05:13:58.100 --> 05:14:03.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: What is your take on lowering the age of criminal responsibility?

asr-006618
05:14:03.100 --> 05:14:07.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Some are proposing from 15 to 12 years of age.

asr-006619
05:14:07.100 --> 05:14:10.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: Like in other jurisdictions, as young as 10,

asr-006620
05:14:10.100 --> 05:14:15.100
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: like Singapore, criminal responsibility already attached.

asr-006621
05:14:15.100 --> 05:14:19.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, I take the position of all our child welfare advocates

asr-006622
05:14:19.100 --> 05:14:21.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: that we are against lowering down

asr-006623
05:14:21.100 --> 05:14:24.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: the minimum age of criminal liability.

asr-006624
05:14:24.100 --> 05:14:27.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We do not want to lower it for the following reasons.

asr-006625
05:14:27.100 --> 05:14:31.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Number one, we have not yet fully implemented the law,

asr-006626
05:14:31.100 --> 05:14:33.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: yet we want to lower it down again.

asr-006627
05:14:33.100 --> 05:14:36.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I think we have to fulfill the provisions,

asr-006628
05:14:36.100 --> 05:14:38.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: as you pointed out, by the law,

asr-006629
05:14:38.100 --> 05:14:41.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: before we can say whether the law is successful

asr-006630
05:14:41.100 --> 05:14:44.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: or whether it's effective or not effective.

asr-006631
05:14:44.100 --> 05:14:47.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pangalawa, after my discussions with Secretary Vida,

asr-006632
05:14:47.100 --> 05:14:50.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: medyo mahirapan rin tayo i-justify sa world stage,

asr-006633
05:14:50.100 --> 05:14:54.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: that from the age of 15,

asr-006634
05:14:54.100 --> 05:14:57.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 14, no, 15, 15,

asr-006635
05:14:57.100 --> 05:14:59.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: biglang ibababa natin,

asr-006636
05:14:59.100 --> 05:15:00.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para tayong

asr-006637
05:15:00.000 --> 05:15:05.200
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: counterintuitive while everybody is doing that. But I do understand where this notion is coming from.

asr-006638
05:15:05.200 --> 05:15:12.080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and in one of the hearings in the senate uh the lowering of the minimum age the science doesn't

asr-006639
05:15:12.080 --> 05:15:19.040
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: show it. The part of the brain of the child, and numerous literature shows na hindi pa siya

asr-006640
05:15:19.040 --> 05:15:24.480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: fully nagde-develop. In fact, without going into too much detail because I'm barred from doing so

asr-006641
05:15:24.480 --> 05:15:31.760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ng jjwa to discuss in in there are other risk factors not just the age we have to address the

asr-006642
05:15:31.760 --> 05:15:36.320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: root cause of the problem as the child psychologist and child psychiatrist handling the takloban case

asr-006643
05:15:36.320 --> 05:15:44.480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pointed out now one risk factor on the individual two risk factor on the family three risk factor on

asr-006644
05:15:44.480 --> 05:15:52.240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: the community, schools, bullying; and four, risk factor na mismo on what's available online.

asr-006645
05:15:52.960 --> 05:15:54.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: i think we can address the

asr-006646
05:15:54.480 --> 05:16:13.200
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: this if we address those various risk factors, not just lowering the age. Kumbaga yung bata na hindi pa fully nagde-develop yung kanyang pag-iisip, ilayo na natin dito sa mga risk factor na maaaring itulak siya na gawin yung hindi niya dapat ginagawa.

asr-006647
05:16:13.200 --> 05:16:16.560
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: thank you for that uh this is secretary we fully acknowledge that parents parental

asr-006648
05:16:16.560 --> 05:16:23.120
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: responsibility is at the core of this one and we always say that discipline starts at home

asr-006649
05:16:24.240 --> 05:16:24.480
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: but

asr-006650
05:16:24.480 --> 05:16:33.920
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: uh if we can infer on the attack loban case that 14 and 15 years old they know

asr-006651
05:16:33.920 --> 05:16:41.120
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: fully well what they are doing in fact they studied the law and use it in their favor um

asr-006652
05:16:43.120 --> 05:16:49.120
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: when they studied the law they say that they will escape criminal responsibility so those are the

asr-006653
05:16:49.840 --> 05:16:54.240
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: uh the the inference that we can take that a 14 year old or a

asr-006654
05:16:54.240 --> 05:17:03.360
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: 15 year old or a 14 year old has this full mental capacity to know the full consequences of this

asr-006655
05:17:03.360 --> 05:17:06.520
Rep. Alfredo A. "Pido" Garbin Jr.: unlawful act

asr-006655-split-2
05:17:06.520 --> 05:17:09.760
