DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: for the pilot. Maliit lamang yung pilot.

asr-007895
06:59:20.940 --> 06:59:22.500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But for 2027,

asr-007896
06:59:22.980 --> 06:59:25.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: it's now at 8.6

asr-007897
06:59:25.000 --> 06:59:25.940
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: million pesos.

asr-007898
06:59:27.580 --> 06:59:28.760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: By the way, Mr. Chair,

asr-007899
06:59:29.140 --> 06:59:30.720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ano kami ho dito? Collaborating

asr-007900
06:59:30.720 --> 06:59:32.820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: partner lang kami ng Dangerous Drug Board.

asr-007901
06:59:33.460 --> 06:59:34.420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Sa kanila talaga yung

asr-007902
06:59:34.420 --> 06:59:36.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: heavy lifting. Kami pumapasok lang kami

asr-007903
06:59:36.640 --> 06:59:38.420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi kami yung merong expertise on

asr-007904
06:59:38.420 --> 06:59:39.980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: psychosocial interventions,

asr-007905
06:59:39.980 --> 06:59:41.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: as well as family support,

asr-007906
06:59:41.900 --> 06:59:43.900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: at yung design. Pero malamang,

asr-007907
06:59:43.900 --> 06:59:46.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: hindi malamang, I'm very confident

asr-007908
06:59:46.360 --> 06:59:48.220
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na pag tinignan nyo yung Dangerous Drug Board,

asr-007909
06:59:48.320 --> 06:59:50.300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: this same program will appear at mas malaki

asr-007910
06:59:50.300 --> 06:59:51.500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: yung budget provision doon.

asr-007911
06:59:51.880 --> 06:59:54.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, okay. So, from

asr-007912
06:59:54.200 --> 06:59:55.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: an initial pilot,

asr-007913
06:59:56.480 --> 06:59:58.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tapos ngayon, for 2027,

asr-007914
06:59:59.140 --> 06:59:59.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 8 million

asr-007915
07:00:00.000 --> 07:00:02.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 8 million, from 900,000 to 8 million?

asr-007916
07:00:02.880 --> 07:00:06.940
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yes, to provide that family intervention in terms of emotional support

asr-007917
07:00:06.940 --> 07:00:10.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para mapalaki pa natin, maparami po yung mga lugar na pinagsisilbihan.

asr-007918
07:00:10.780 --> 07:00:11.260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Thank you po.

asr-007919
07:00:11.940 --> 07:00:16.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next topic, haugnay po sa social pension beneficiaries.

asr-007920
07:00:16.620 --> 07:00:20.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito po yung under Republic Act 11916,

asr-007921
07:00:21.020 --> 07:00:25.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 1,000 pesos monthly pension to qualified indigent senior citizens.

asr-007922
07:00:26.360 --> 07:00:29.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I think in your presentation kanina, correct me if I wrong,

asr-007923
07:00:29.820 --> 07:00:34.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: if I'm wrong, may pinakita kayong statistics,

asr-007924
07:00:34.680 --> 07:00:40.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: something like 550,000 qualified indigent senior citizens

asr-007925
07:00:40.700 --> 07:00:45.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero hindi pa nakikinabang, hindi nakakatanggap nitong 1,000.

asr-007926
07:00:45.060 --> 07:00:45.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So was that correct?

asr-007927
07:00:46.640 --> 07:00:48.160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Che, let me qualify that statement.

asr-007928
07:00:48.400 --> 07:00:51.720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yung 550,000, yan ho yung natagpuan namin sa CBMS.

asr-007929
07:00:52.460 --> 07:00:55.560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero recently nga, alam namin na mas malaki pa yung numero.

asr-007930
07:00:55.940 --> 07:00:57.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: It's almost double of what we're doing right now.

asr-007931
07:00:57.980 --> 07:00:59.660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero hindi namin sila mahanap sa CBMS.

asr-007932
07:01:00.220 --> 07:01:01.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So tulad ng sinabi namin,

asr-007933
07:01:01.800 --> 07:01:05.060
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: nag-propose kami ng panibagong mekanismo sa PSA

asr-007934
07:01:05.060 --> 07:01:08.180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kung saan yung mga waitlist sa mga local government units,

asr-007935
07:01:08.240 --> 07:01:09.620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sa mga OSCA offices nila,

asr-007936
07:01:10.020 --> 07:01:12.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kinukuha namin, ipapasa namin sa PSA

asr-007937
07:01:12.440 --> 07:01:14.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: to tell them na wala sa CBMS

asr-007938
07:01:14.400 --> 07:01:17.140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pero pakitignan, may birth registry ba ito?

asr-007939
07:01:17.320 --> 07:01:18.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: At wala pa sa death registry.

asr-007940
07:01:19.220 --> 07:01:22.240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kung susuma, total natin yun, it's almost double.

asr-007941
07:01:22.380 --> 07:01:25.780
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi as mentioned nga, ang population ng senior citizen natin

asr-007942
07:01:25.780 --> 07:01:28.820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: nasa 11 million, pero ang nakikater lang namin yan

asr-007943
07:01:28.820 --> 07:01:29.780
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: is almost 5.

asr-007944
07:01:29.820 --> 07:01:31.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 5 million or 5.5 million.

asr-007945
07:01:32.040 --> 07:01:35.860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yung binanggit ko kanina na 550,000, yun lang yun na sa CBMS.

asr-007946
07:01:36.300 --> 07:01:36.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007947
07:01:38.680 --> 07:01:43.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa inyong tansya, 11 million ang qualified indigent senior citizens?

asr-007948
07:01:45.040 --> 07:01:46.880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Those are senior citizens.

asr-007949
07:01:47.020 --> 07:01:49.300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi pa namin namin sila naiisa-isa

asr-007950
07:01:49.300 --> 07:01:51.320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: because we don't want to raise their hopes.

asr-007951
07:01:51.540 --> 07:01:55.200
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But, nasa waitlist sila ng LGUs.

asr-007952
07:01:55.300 --> 07:01:58.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So some type of validation or application has been launched already.

asr-007953
07:01:58.840 --> 07:01:58.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007954
07:01:59.620 --> 07:02:00.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero, okay.

asr-007955
07:02:01.100 --> 07:02:03.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung total universe, kumbaga, 11 million.

asr-007956
07:02:03.940 --> 07:02:08.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos ang sinasabi nyo, ang nabibigyan pala ngayon ng 1,000, 5.5 million.

asr-007957
07:02:09.000 --> 07:02:09.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Is that correct?

asr-007958
07:02:10.920 --> 07:02:12.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4.2 million.

asr-007959
07:02:12.200 --> 07:02:13.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4.2 million.

asr-007960
07:02:13.520 --> 07:02:14.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So potentially,

asr-007961
07:02:15.500 --> 07:02:16.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ilan yun?

asr-007962
07:02:16.920 --> 07:02:18.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It's almost double.

asr-007963
07:02:19.440 --> 07:02:20.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: More than double.

asr-007964
07:02:22.600 --> 07:02:23.940
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Almost double, you're correct.

asr-007965
07:02:24.080 --> 07:02:24.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007966
07:02:24.400 --> 07:02:29.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, for 2027,

asr-007967
07:02:31.100 --> 07:02:39.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ilan po ang target n'yong madagdag sa 4.5 million na kasalukuyang beneficiaries?

asr-007968
07:02:43.400 --> 07:02:47.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And do you have the budget proposal for that?

asr-007969
07:02:48.240 --> 07:02:51.740
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, it's part of the list that we intended to submit today,

asr-007970
07:02:51.860 --> 07:02:54.520
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: but we will edit because of the discussions this afternoon.

asr-007971
07:02:54.920 --> 07:02:58.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 6.8 billion pa ho na karagdagan ang hinihingi natin

asr-007972
07:02:58.400 --> 07:03:02.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: to be able to cover the more than double na hindi nila sa service.

asr-007973
07:03:02.720 --> 07:03:03.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, tina-target nyo?

asr-007974
07:03:03.400 --> 07:03:03.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tina-target nyo?

asr-007975
07:03:03.460 --> 07:03:06.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tina-target nyo na maabot lahat for 2027,

asr-007976
07:03:06.700 --> 07:03:10.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kaya meron kayong proposal for over 6 billion additional.

asr-007977
07:03:11.100 --> 07:03:11.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: That is correct.

asr-007978
07:03:11.980 --> 07:03:12.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007979
07:03:12.860 --> 07:03:13.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Masalamat po.

asr-007980
07:03:13.580 --> 07:03:15.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And we will support that, of course.

asr-007981
07:03:16.180 --> 07:03:20.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: If you will propose that as an institutional amendment.

asr-007982
07:03:21.600 --> 07:03:21.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007983
07:03:22.720 --> 07:03:23.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung isang tanong na lang po,

asr-007984
07:03:24.000 --> 07:03:28.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung kaugnay naman sa Expanded Centenarians Act.

asr-007985
07:03:30.000 --> 07:03:31.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayon dito,

asr-007986
07:03:31.000 --> 07:03:36.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, upon reaching 80, 85, 90, 95 ng mga senior citizens,

asr-007987
07:03:37.100 --> 07:03:39.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: they are entitled to a cash gift of 10,000.

asr-007988
07:03:40.340 --> 07:03:40.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-007989
07:03:43.240 --> 07:03:47.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang tanong po, ang concern ay, siyempre,

asr-007990
07:03:49.220 --> 07:03:50.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung matagal yung proseso minsan,

asr-007991
07:03:50.820 --> 07:03:53.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: baka hindi na mapakinabangan ng mga senior citizens natin.

asr-007992
07:03:53.960 --> 07:03:55.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ano po ang status ng implementation nito?

asr-007993
07:03:55.960 --> 07:03:56.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So,

asr-007994
07:03:56.160 --> 07:03:59.880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Cheras earlier stated,

asr-007995
07:04:00.100 --> 07:04:02.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I would yield the floor to the NCSC representative

asr-007996
07:04:02.920 --> 07:04:04.860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: dahil supervised agency sila.

asr-007997
07:04:05.380 --> 07:04:09.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And in the letters na back and forth na binasa kanina ni Congresswoman Magsaysay,

asr-007998
07:04:09.520 --> 07:04:12.740
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: they made it very clear that we are only to coordinate with them

asr-007999
07:04:12.740 --> 07:04:14.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: but not to interfere with their operations.

asr-008000
07:04:15.540 --> 07:04:19.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, I would leave the answering to somebody who is more competent on the matter,

asr-008001
07:04:20.400 --> 07:04:24.400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: which is the NCSC Executive Director who is with us this afternoon.

asr-008002
07:04:25.360 --> 07:04:26.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sige po.

asr-008003
07:04:26.160 --> 07:04:30.020
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Good afternoon po, Chair.

asr-008004
07:04:30.480 --> 07:04:34.460
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: With the indulgence of our Secretary Rex, Rep. Tinio,

asr-008005
07:04:34.820 --> 07:04:37.260
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: regarding the implementation of the ECA,

asr-008006
07:04:37.880 --> 07:04:46.100
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: we have already served 179,000 senior citizens as of August.

asr-008007
07:04:46.920 --> 07:04:54.560
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: And we have already utilized almost 2 billion of our 3.4 million budget.

asr-008008
07:04:56.710 --> 07:04:57.510
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ilan po? 100?

asr-008009
07:04:57.510 --> 07:04:58.470
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 100?

asr-008010
07:04:59.170 --> 07:05:03.250
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: 179,000 na po mahigit ang ating nasa-serve na senior citizens.

asr-008011
07:05:03.250 --> 07:05:04.350
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anong time frame po niyan?

asr-008012
07:05:04.730 --> 07:05:06.570
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung 179,000 na yan?

asr-008013
07:05:06.590 --> 07:05:08.990
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: As of August po, 2026.

asr-008014
07:05:09.190 --> 07:05:10.330
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Is it just for this year?

asr-008015
07:05:10.650 --> 07:05:11.510
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: This fiscal year?

asr-008016
07:05:12.050 --> 07:05:12.790
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung figure niyo?

asr-008017
07:05:13.390 --> 07:05:14.250
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Yes, sir.

asr-008018
07:05:14.690 --> 07:05:19.910
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Bale, ang target po for this year ay nasa 299,000 senior citizens.

asr-008019
07:05:20.210 --> 07:05:20.330
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008020
07:05:20.750 --> 07:05:20.990
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Opo.

asr-008021
07:05:21.650 --> 07:05:22.690
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, of that?

asr-008022
07:05:23.010 --> 07:05:27.930
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Of that po, yung mga applications na na-process and nabigyan na po natin ay

asr-008023
07:05:27.930 --> 07:05:28.890
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: 179,000.

asr-008024
07:05:28.890 --> 07:05:29.150
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 179,000.

asr-008025
07:05:29.170 --> 07:05:32.450
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nabigyan sila ng 10,000?

asr-008026
07:05:33.130 --> 07:05:36.850
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Yung iba po, 100,000 kapag kapag nag-100 years old.

asr-008027
07:05:37.130 --> 07:05:37.390
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008028
07:05:37.790 --> 07:05:39.670
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Gano'ng katagal po yung processing time?

asr-008029
07:05:39.770 --> 07:05:41.170
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nasusunod po ba yung...

asr-008030
07:05:41.950 --> 07:05:44.150
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Gano'ng katagal po, average processing time?

asr-008031
07:05:44.710 --> 07:05:48.430
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Quarterly po kasi kami nagdi-distribute ng aming gift

asr-008032
07:05:48.430 --> 07:05:53.650
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: because of budgetary constraints in the distribution of the gifts.

asr-008033
07:05:54.770 --> 07:05:55.090
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008034
07:05:56.590 --> 07:05:59.010
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung nasa budget nyo na...

asr-008035
07:05:59.010 --> 07:05:59.250
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ilan yun?

asr-008036
07:05:59.310 --> 07:05:59.710
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 200?

asr-008037
07:06:01.070 --> 07:06:03.050
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Ang budget po namin for this year...

asr-008038
07:06:03.050 --> 07:06:03.570
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For this year?

asr-008039
07:06:04.030 --> 07:06:06.730
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Ay 3.2 billion.

asr-008040
07:06:07.830 --> 07:06:09.230
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For how many beneficiaries?

asr-008041
07:06:10.610 --> 07:06:11.330
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For how many?

asr-008042
07:06:11.850 --> 07:06:13.230
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: 299,000 senior citizens.

asr-008043
07:06:13.530 --> 07:06:15.250
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 299,000 senior citizens.

asr-008044
07:06:15.390 --> 07:06:21.950
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan po ba yung tansya nyo na lahat na maaring mag-qualify?

asr-008045
07:06:22.330 --> 07:06:24.310
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Yan po ay PSA projection.

asr-008046
07:06:24.550 --> 07:06:25.470
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: PSA projection.

asr-008047
07:06:25.870 --> 07:06:26.070
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008048
07:06:26.070 --> 07:06:28.070
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, sa tansya nyo, kayang ma...

asr-008049
07:06:29.010 --> 07:06:30.890
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Abot ang 100% dito?

asr-008050
07:06:31.310 --> 07:06:33.890
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Sa tansya po namin, sa dami po ng applications,

asr-008051
07:06:34.190 --> 07:06:37.650
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: mukhang kukulangin po yung tansya namin na 299,000.

asr-008052
07:06:37.870 --> 07:06:38.970
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kukulangin ng pondo?

asr-008053
07:06:39.730 --> 07:06:42.070
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Opo, kasi marami pong applications.

asr-008054
07:06:42.350 --> 07:06:45.470
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: As of now, nasa halos 200,000 eh.

asr-008055
07:06:46.770 --> 07:06:48.070
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: 179 na yung na-serve.

asr-008056
07:06:48.430 --> 07:06:52.150
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Ongoing pa po yung aming cash gift distribution hanggang sa ngayon.

asr-008057
07:06:52.950 --> 07:06:55.630
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: And ang sineserve na namin,

asr-008058
07:06:55.630 --> 07:06:58.870
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: mga 20-24.

asr-008059
07:06:59.010 --> 07:07:00.490
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Nag-birthday, 20-25.

asr-008060
07:07:00.610 --> 07:07:02.790
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Nag-birthday, ngayon lang po nag-a-apply yung iba.

asr-008061
07:07:03.650 --> 07:07:04.170
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Kasi...

asr-008062
07:07:04.170 --> 07:07:06.730
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Gano'ng katagal o kabilis po ang processing time nyo?

asr-008063
07:07:06.810 --> 07:07:10.070
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan po ang concern ng mga lumapit sa amin na

asr-008064
07:07:10.070 --> 07:07:13.390
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nag-aalala sila na masyadong matagal yung processing time.

asr-008065
07:07:14.450 --> 07:07:17.350
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Opo, kasi every 3 months lang po kami nakaka-apply.

asr-008066
07:07:17.350 --> 07:07:18.410
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Every 3 months.

asr-008067
07:07:18.850 --> 07:07:19.130
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008068
07:07:21.450 --> 07:07:23.690
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kano po ang proposal for next year?

asr-008069
07:07:23.690 --> 07:07:25.730
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And how many beneficiaries?

asr-008070
07:07:26.850 --> 07:07:28.010
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: For this year po.

asr-008071
07:07:28.030 --> 07:07:28.710
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For next year.

asr-008072
07:07:28.710 --> 07:07:30.190
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung sa budget proposal nyo.

asr-008073
07:07:30.810 --> 07:07:36.490
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: For next year po, ang proposal namin ay nasa 303,000 na higit na senior citizens.

asr-008074
07:07:36.930 --> 07:07:40.150
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: And ang budget po ay nasa 3.8 billion.

asr-008075
07:07:40.330 --> 07:07:41.970
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa tingin nyo, sapat ang budget na yan?

asr-008076
07:07:43.450 --> 07:07:47.550
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Makakarequest naman po kami sakali pong lumampas po sa 303,000

asr-008077
07:07:47.550 --> 07:07:49.190
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: ang nag-apply na senior citizens.

asr-008078
07:07:49.310 --> 07:07:50.390
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Makakarequest kayo kanino?

asr-008079
07:07:50.610 --> 07:07:51.550
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Sa DBM po.

asr-008080
07:07:52.270 --> 07:07:55.590
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, sa DBM. You mean for augmentation from savings?

asr-008081
07:07:56.690 --> 07:07:57.350
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Gano'n po ba yun?

asr-008082
07:07:57.830 --> 07:07:58.690
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: May iba po.

asr-008083
07:07:58.710 --> 07:08:01.070
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May iba pa bang source ang DBM?

asr-008084
07:08:01.590 --> 07:08:09.150
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Kasi po, pag nag-apply, saka lang po kami makakahingi ng augmentation sa budget.

asr-008085
07:08:09.250 --> 07:08:10.170
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Sige.

asr-008086
07:08:10.670 --> 07:08:12.550
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Yun na lang po ang tanong natin.

asr-008087
07:08:12.570 --> 07:08:15.470
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman, if I can just add for the information of Rep. Tinio.

asr-008088
07:08:15.990 --> 07:08:17.370
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ulitin ko, ko-coordination po kami.

asr-008089
07:08:17.930 --> 07:08:23.230
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: At nung iniwan po namin yung programa, we have highly encouraged ang NCSC to work with PSA.

asr-008090
07:08:23.230 --> 07:08:28.430
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi remember, may CDMS naman po na po-forecast natin in advance.

asr-008091
07:08:28.430 --> 07:08:31.770
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Sino ang mag-80, 85, 90, 95, 100.

asr-008092
07:08:32.490 --> 07:08:34.770
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: It doesn't have to be a by-application process.

asr-008093
07:08:34.910 --> 07:08:38.230
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi I think, yung concern ho niyo, Congressman, doon na nga nga na ko,

asr-008094
07:08:38.350 --> 07:08:40.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: yung nag-apply ako, nag-aantay ako.

asr-008095
07:08:40.530 --> 07:08:44.330
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi minsan, mali yung, hindi pa mali, but mali yung projection.

asr-008096
07:08:44.690 --> 07:08:47.050
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But it's not a rocket science po.

asr-008097
07:08:47.150 --> 07:08:49.650
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The CDMS actually points us to the way.

asr-008098
07:08:50.090 --> 07:08:54.250
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're now tallying it nga kasi may kopya ho kami niyan dahil nga sa social pension,

asr-008099
07:08:54.710 --> 07:08:57.190
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ilan ang forecasted.

asr-008100
07:08:57.190 --> 07:09:03.110
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But we can submit it to you and we will continue to encourage the NCSC to look at the paradigm

asr-008101
07:09:03.110 --> 07:09:08.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na i-forecast na lang natin in advance para tama po yung mahingi na pera sa DBM

asr-008102
07:09:08.270 --> 07:09:11.550
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: at tayo na ho ang lalapit sa kanila kesa sila ang lalapit sa atin.

asr-008103
07:09:13.250 --> 07:09:20.250
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you po and we would appreciate yung may sasubmit na information ni Secretary Rex, Chair.

asr-008104
07:09:20.690 --> 07:09:23.790
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So please po, pakibigay lang po. Thank you.

asr-008105
07:09:24.810 --> 07:09:26.450
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun na lang po, Chair. Maraming salamat.

asr-008106
07:09:26.450 --> 07:09:27.170
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you.

asr-008107
07:09:27.220 --> 07:09:29.600
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Congressman Tinio.

asr-008107-split-2
07:09:29.600 --> 07:09:33.930
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: We now recognize Congressman Tonypet Albano.

asr-008108
07:09:34.310 --> 07:09:35.470
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Maraming salamat, Chair.

asr-008109
07:09:36.310 --> 07:09:43.190
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Unang-una, ako'y proud na proud sa aking kaibigan na si Secretary Rex Cachalian.

asr-008110
07:09:44.230 --> 07:09:50.290
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Sana katulad ko makahanap ka ng kabyak sa puso.

asr-008111
07:09:50.290 --> 07:09:57.170
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Yun din ang aking mensahe kay Senator, Senate President na kapatid mo.

asr-008112
07:09:57.190 --> 07:09:58.630
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Uyung single and available.

asr-008113
07:10:00.150 --> 07:10:06.290
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Sana tularan mo akong 32 years younger at makahanap ng pagmamahal ulit.

asr-008114
07:10:08.550 --> 07:10:15.830
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: I'd really just like to wish you well because you have been doing well with the Department of Social Welfare and Development.

asr-008115
07:10:16.010 --> 07:10:20.270
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: In fact, I see the Regional Director here, Director Lucy Alan.

asr-008116
07:10:21.030 --> 07:10:22.750
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Please, can you please stand up?

asr-008117
07:10:22.750 --> 07:10:24.370
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Exemplary po.

asr-008118
07:10:25.030 --> 07:10:25.750
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Ang inyong...

asr-008119
07:10:27.190 --> 07:10:36.410
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Kawani sa gobyerno doon dahil ito po talaga nakikita namin ang pagtrabaho niya sa buong regyon ay kagalang-galang at napakagaling.

asr-008120
07:10:37.390 --> 07:10:49.790
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: At maraming salamat sa inyong serbisyo, Director Lucy, at sana po magkaroon pa ng mas madaming kagaya po niya dahil talaga truly deserving po siya.

asr-008121
07:10:49.790 --> 07:11:09.770
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Sa inyo po, open invitation po ang probinsya ng Isabela at Region 2 dahil alam ko po kung gano'ng kamahal ng kababayan ko ang inyong serbisyo, lalo na yung mga IECs na binibigyan nyo, lalong-lalo na ngayon at may mga baha at mga problema sa atin po.

asr-008122
07:11:09.950 --> 07:11:19.000
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: So full support po ako, bagamat gusto ko na ho i-terminate ito para makauwi kayo at magkaroon kayo ng trabaho. Karagdagan,

asr-008123
07:11:19.000 --> 07:11:43.710
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Hihintayin po natin si Chairwoman Mika Suansing para i-close po ito. At rest assured, Secretary, kung pwede pong dagdagan pa yung pondo sa inyo, nang sa ganoon makatulong pa po sa lahat ng nangangailangang Pilipino, welcome po, sabihin nyo lang po at ipaglalaban ko po ang budget ng DSWD under the leadership of Secretary Rex Gatchalian po.

asr-008124
07:11:44.850 --> 07:11:48.210
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Thank you, Chair. Thank you, Congressman Tonypet. Maraming salamat.

asr-008125
07:11:48.210 --> 07:11:49.630
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: Thank you.

asr-008126
07:11:49.790 --> 07:12:14.470
Rep. Antonio "Tonypet" T. Albano: At open invitation po sa Isabela kung makakapunta po kayo, hindi sa kasal ko talaga, tapos na yung kasal. Kung meron po kayong panahon, gusto namin po kayong imbitahin para makita nyo naman po kung ano lahat yung mga natulungan yung mga kaprominsyan mo namin sa Region 2. Maraming salamat po, Secretary Rex.

asr-008127
07:12:18.510 --> 07:12:20.390
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you. Thank you, Congressman.

asr-008128
07:12:20.390 --> 07:12:22.050
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: May we recognize?

asr-008129
07:12:23.250 --> 07:12:26.110
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: SDS, D-9, D-9S.

asr-008130
07:12:26.850 --> 07:12:38.410
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Sek, kung anong to, isang tanong lang. Yung tertiary education subsidy went through your portal, diba? That's about 400,000 students, scholars.

asr-008131
07:12:41.580 --> 07:12:42.900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: E-portal is with CHED, sir.

asr-008132
07:12:43.280 --> 07:12:53.600
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero you submit to them a list. You submit them a list. Kasi maliit lang yung, hindi namin na-increase yung katilang allowance, no?

asr-008133
07:12:53.600 --> 07:12:55.340
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: It used to be 60,000.

asr-008134
07:12:55.360 --> 07:13:05.060
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Naging 30,000. So, it's like 15,000 per semester. As against before, 30,000 per semester.

asr-008135
07:13:05.800 --> 07:13:17.560
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ngayon, since it went through the portal naman, kayo nagbibigay nung name. In fact, marami rin nag-question na, like in my district, no?

asr-008136
07:13:17.560 --> 07:13:22.980
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: City of Coronadal is the regional center. We have no state college.

asr-008137
07:13:23.940 --> 07:13:25.280
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, lahat.

asr-008138
07:13:25.280 --> 07:13:32.080
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: At nag-a-avail ng UniFAST TES. Kasi lahat ng private school nasa City of Koronadal.

asr-008139
07:13:32.660 --> 07:13:42.580
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And all, ngayon, ang bagong policy, kailangan na kukunin yung mga new beneficiaries sa portal ng DSWD.

asr-008140
07:13:45.340 --> 07:13:49.140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, yung portal nasa CHED, what we do is...

asr-008141
07:13:49.140 --> 07:13:50.780
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero yung listahan, galing sa DSWD.

asr-008142
07:13:50.780 --> 07:13:55.480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Since time immemorial po, even before this new TES law, nagsasubmit kami ng list sa kanila.

asr-008143
07:13:55.480 --> 07:14:00.140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ng mga 4Ps na eligible na dahil pagkukulehyo na po.

asr-008144
07:14:00.200 --> 07:14:02.180
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Kasi ngayon talagang in-implement na.

asr-008145
07:14:02.400 --> 07:14:05.840
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Na talagang galing lang sa listahan ninyo.

asr-008146
07:14:06.460 --> 07:14:19.620
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, dahil hindi naman na-increase yung subsidy, ay yung allowance, is it possible na kung sino man yung mga nasa listahan, pwedeng maka-avail ng student assistance?

asr-008147
07:14:20.860 --> 07:14:25.240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Theoretically, Mr. Chair, yun ho sa pagkakaunawa namin yung essence ng bagong amendment.

asr-008148
07:14:25.480 --> 07:14:32.600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, yung eligibility requirement, yung sa TES lang ho, hindi yun sa amin.

asr-008149
07:14:32.700 --> 07:14:35.940
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, meaning, lahat ng eligible, ipapadala namin sa kanila.

asr-008150
07:14:36.460 --> 07:14:43.800
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Then, we'll tell our parents na punta na kayo sa State U, make sure mag-comply po kayo doon sa eligibility requirements nila.

asr-008151
07:14:43.820 --> 07:14:54.400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Hindi, walang problema doon. Pero what I'm saying, kung pasok na sila doon, gusto naming dagdagan, can we go through DSWD?

asr-008152
07:14:54.400 --> 07:14:55.460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-008153
07:14:55.480 --> 07:14:58.320
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Kasi that's the only way na madagdagan yung...

asr-008154
07:14:58.320 --> 07:14:59.540
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: By all means, Mr. Chair.

asr-008155
07:15:00.000 --> 07:15:11.900
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Importante yun kasi at least kahit papano, we can find a way na madagdagan kahit konti yung kanilang subsidy.

asr-008156
07:15:12.700 --> 07:15:16.460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, nasa menu pa rin naman ng AICS yan, so pwede po.

asr-008157
07:15:16.660 --> 07:15:25.260
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Okay. Yun lang, importante yun kasi at least alam ko, pwede ko na silang, pag nalista na sila, pwede pa ako magdagdag sa kanila.

asr-008158
07:15:25.640 --> 07:15:26.380
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-008159
07:15:26.380 --> 07:15:32.140
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you, SDS. We recognize kong Mila Magsaysay.

asr-008160
07:15:33.420 --> 07:15:46.000
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Thank you, Mr. Chair. We did everything po na makreate itong NCSC, National Commission on Senior Citizens,

asr-008161
07:15:46.660 --> 07:15:53.680
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: para po meron na talagang sariling komisyon ang mga senior citizens para maalagaan naman po sila ng mabuti.

asr-008162
07:15:53.680 --> 07:15:53.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Okay.

asr-008163
07:15:53.780 --> 07:15:59.040
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi ito na lang po, komisyon na ito, ang focus niya ay senior citizen.

asr-008164
07:15:59.820 --> 07:16:03.300
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So ngayon po, nagkukulang talaga ang budget nila.

asr-008165
07:16:03.900 --> 07:16:15.980
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi unang-una na sila, kasi hindi nabibigay agad-agad yung centenary yan, yung 80-85-90-95.

asr-008166
07:16:15.980 --> 07:16:19.980
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: E ang ano naman po nito ay talaga naman pong underman sila.

asr-008167
07:16:20.840 --> 07:16:22.380
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kulang po sila sa tao.

asr-008168
07:16:22.700 --> 07:16:23.740
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: No, kulang pa sila.

asr-008169
07:16:23.780 --> 07:16:24.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Sa mga empleyado.

asr-008170
07:16:26.020 --> 07:16:32.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So kung pwede po, ay humihingi sila ng additional na magkaroon ng job order.

asr-008171
07:16:33.340 --> 07:16:35.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Maski man lang po, two per province.

asr-008172
07:16:37.020 --> 07:16:41.340
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Para po, kasi we have only regional offices now, 18.

asr-008173
07:16:41.880 --> 07:16:45.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: 18 regions po, including Negros, 17.

asr-008174
07:16:46.920 --> 07:16:48.660
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So 18 regions na po.

asr-008175
07:16:48.660 --> 07:16:53.660
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So paano makaka-centenary yan?

asr-008176
07:16:53.780 --> 07:16:57.940
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kung ilan lang po yung manpower nila.

asr-008177
07:16:58.520 --> 07:17:02.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So ngayon, they're asking for additional job orders.

asr-008178
07:17:02.940 --> 07:17:04.920
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Maski two per province man lang.

asr-008179
07:17:05.380 --> 07:17:11.620
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Para efficiently, maano nila yung programs and projects na nasa sa kanila.

asr-008180
07:17:12.620 --> 07:17:21.460
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: At saka itong ATOP, nung nandun sa DSWD, ay 7.5 million ang budget.

asr-008181
07:17:21.460 --> 07:17:28.180
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi noon, ano lang, FESCAP lang ang organization.

asr-008182
07:17:28.640 --> 07:17:31.680
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Ngayon, marami na pong senior citizens organization.

asr-008183
07:17:32.500 --> 07:17:39.640
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So kailangan naman po, mas malaki pa po ang ibigay na budget para makatulong po sila sa mga organizations.

asr-008184
07:17:40.300 --> 07:17:42.540
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So they're asking for 17 million.

asr-008185
07:17:43.020 --> 07:17:45.880
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Now they're given only 3.3 million.

asr-008186
07:17:45.880 --> 07:17:51.300
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Sa naman po, aabot ito sa dami ng mga senior citizens.

asr-008187
07:17:51.300 --> 07:17:59.540
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So ito pa po, ano na po ito, batas na po itong digitalization.

asr-008188
07:18:00.240 --> 07:18:06.340
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi nag-gagather po sila ng data and information ng mga senior citizens.

asr-008189
07:18:07.080 --> 07:18:17.460
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So they were asking for 48 million para ma-digitalization ang NCSC.

asr-008190
07:18:17.460 --> 07:18:21.120
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Pero zero po ang ibinigay sa kanila.

asr-008191
07:18:21.300 --> 07:18:36.300
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: E batas na po ito na lahat po ng government agencies, government offices should be digitalized para maging digital po sila.

asr-008192
07:18:36.480 --> 07:18:40.420
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So ito naman po, zero pong binigay.

asr-008193
07:18:40.860 --> 07:18:42.300
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: They're asking for 48.

asr-008194
07:18:42.300 --> 07:18:49.300
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Baka naman po pwede na po nating ibigay ito para lalo pong makagather po sila ng information

asr-008195
07:18:49.300 --> 07:18:59.600
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: tungkol sa mga senior citizens para mas madali po ang pagbibigay ng mga benefits and privileges ng mga seniors.

asr-008196
07:19:00.640 --> 07:19:02.500
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Ito naman po, livelihood.

asr-008197
07:19:03.400 --> 07:19:06.860
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kailangan-kailangan po ng mga senior citizens ang livelihood.

asr-008198
07:19:08.160 --> 07:19:10.260
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Humingi po sila ng 54 million.

asr-008199
07:19:10.760 --> 07:19:12.600
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: 4 million lang po ang binigay.

asr-008200
07:19:12.940 --> 07:19:15.380
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: 12 million po ang senior citizens.

asr-008201
07:19:15.640 --> 07:19:17.880
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Napakadami po ang mga organizations.

asr-008202
07:19:17.880 --> 07:19:20.840
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kailangan po nila ang livelihood.

asr-008203
07:19:21.500 --> 07:19:36.300
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi para po ang mga senior citizens, hindi na po umaasa sa ayuda na pumipila po sila dyan para lang sa 2,000 na mukha silang kawawa at nawawala ng dignidad ang mga senior citizens.

asr-008204
07:19:36.300 --> 07:19:47.860
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So kung pwede po, dagdagan naman po ang livelihood para mabigyan nila ng livelihood ang mga senior citizens para magiging makatayo po sila sa sarili.

asr-008205
07:19:47.880 --> 07:19:51.280
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Hindi po sila umaasa ng mga ayuda.

asr-008206
07:19:53.260 --> 07:19:55.860
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: NCSC asked for 54 million.

asr-008207
07:19:56.680 --> 07:19:58.700
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: 4 million lang po ang ibinigay.

asr-008208
07:19:59.000 --> 07:20:04.800
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Saan naman po dadating yung 4 million sa livelihood ng 12 million senior citizens?

asr-008209
07:20:05.800 --> 07:20:06.480
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So yan po.

asr-008210
07:20:07.060 --> 07:20:08.540
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: At ito pa po, isa pa po.

asr-008211
07:20:09.760 --> 07:20:13.840
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Yung mga nagbibigay ng mga benefits,

asr-008212
07:20:14.580 --> 07:20:17.800
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: daladala po nila yung pera, nagtatricycle po sila.

asr-008213
07:20:17.880 --> 07:20:22.820
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi wala pong service ang mga regional offices.

asr-008214
07:20:23.440 --> 07:20:37.460
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So kung pwede po, mabigyan po sila, mas kisa lang pong service kada region para naman po may sasakyan yung mga magbibigay ng mga benefits ng mga senior citizens.

asr-008215
07:20:37.460 --> 07:20:45.460
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So they were asking for a capital outlay of 111,300,000.

asr-008216
07:20:45.600 --> 07:20:47.600
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Zero po ang ibinigay.

asr-008217
07:20:47.880 --> 07:21:02.520
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Paano po magiging efficient ang NCSC sa pagbibigay ng mga benefits kung wala man lang po silang sasakyan para magbigay ng mga beneficyo na ito?

asr-008218
07:21:03.140 --> 07:21:06.140
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: At wala po silang security guard.

asr-008219
07:21:06.580 --> 07:21:09.100
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Eh naghahawak po sila ng mga millions.

asr-008220
07:21:09.100 --> 07:21:17.360
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So yan po, itong capital outlay, dito po pupunta sa vehicle per province.

asr-008221
07:21:17.880 --> 07:21:22.400
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Itong vehicle, at saka yung gasolina po, at saka security guard.

asr-008222
07:21:23.080 --> 07:21:29.280
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Ngayon po, all in all, ang Negros Island region po, wala pong budget.

asr-008223
07:21:29.980 --> 07:21:33.580
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Eh kailangan din po ng region na yan ng budget nila.

asr-008224
07:21:33.860 --> 07:21:35.060
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Wala po silang budget.

asr-008225
07:21:35.060 --> 07:21:41.280
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So they are requesting 498 million.

asr-008226
07:21:41.920 --> 07:21:46.300
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Ang naibigay lang po is 314 million.

asr-008227
07:21:46.760 --> 07:21:47.060
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: A difference of...

asr-008228
07:21:47.880 --> 07:21:50.200
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Of 184 million.

asr-008229
07:21:50.660 --> 07:21:52.960
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Siguro naman po, napakaliit po yan.

asr-008230
07:21:53.580 --> 07:22:01.360
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Na hinihingi, nakaragdagan, para they can efficiently implement projects and programs

asr-008231
07:22:01.360 --> 07:22:07.720
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: and give benefits to the senior citizens faster and on time.

asr-008232
07:22:10.120 --> 07:22:11.540
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: That's all for the budget of NCSC.

asr-008233
07:22:11.540 --> 07:22:17.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mr. Chair, if I may answer, even if I'm not from NCSC, kasi nandito ho yung representative ng DBM,

asr-008234
07:22:17.880 --> 07:22:19.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I'm quite familiar with the issue.

asr-008235
07:22:20.400 --> 07:22:27.460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tulad nung nabanggit ko kanina, we need to project kasi properly yung catchment natin o yung physical targets natin.

asr-008236
07:22:27.880 --> 07:22:33.620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang main mandate naman ho ng NCSC at this point in time will be the expanded centenarian.

asr-008237
07:22:34.160 --> 07:22:41.360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So what's happening from my understanding, kaya ho, minsan kulang yung na-appropriate together with the admin costs.

asr-008238
07:22:41.780 --> 07:22:46.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi pag may admin costs naman yan, makakapag-hire sila ng COS nila.

asr-008239
07:22:46.760 --> 07:22:47.720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then later on...

asr-008240
07:22:47.720 --> 07:22:50.280
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: DBM can also provide the other support services.

asr-008241
07:22:50.880 --> 07:22:59.440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Eh, yung physical targets kasi pabaliktad, post, mag-a-apply ka muna, susuriin, tsaka natin hihingiin yung pera.

asr-008242
07:22:59.560 --> 07:23:01.140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya give or take may shortfall.

asr-008243
07:23:01.400 --> 07:23:08.420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We've already coordinated with NCSC at we're encouraging them to sign a data sharing agreement with PSA

asr-008244
07:23:08.420 --> 07:23:12.020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para makuha nila yung CBMS kasi napoproject po yun.

asr-008245
07:23:12.640 --> 07:23:17.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The 80, 85, 90, 95, and 100, napoproject yun three years in advance.

asr-008246
07:23:17.720 --> 07:23:26.740
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi I would assume, I would like to think the good congressman believes na huwag na natin antayin silang lumapit kundi tayo ang lumapit.

asr-008247
07:23:27.180 --> 07:23:33.040
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So if they have a three-year rolling plan as we recommended, na alam na nila yung kanila mga physical targets,

asr-008248
07:23:33.520 --> 07:23:38.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I'm sure Secretary Kim and the DBM family will grant them the necessary subsidies.

asr-008249
07:23:39.240 --> 07:23:47.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Together, nakap-embed na doon yung administrative costs for them to be able to hire more contract of service if that's what they need.

asr-008250
07:23:47.000 --> 07:23:47.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi lang hudala.

asr-008251
07:23:47.720 --> 07:23:55.340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi siyempre kung malaki yung subsidy mo, may kaakibat po yan na MOE or admin costs.

asr-008252
07:23:55.660 --> 07:23:59.300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I think at more than 5%, ang admin costs at more than 5%.

asr-008253
07:23:59.300 --> 07:24:06.380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So ang punto ko doon, I think we have to look at it from a paradigm na huwag sila nag-a-apply kundi tayo ang gumawa ng three-year rolling plan

asr-008254
07:24:06.380 --> 07:24:12.740
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para naka-forecast na actuarial style ilan ang magiging 80, 85, 90, 95 way, way in advance.

asr-008255
07:24:12.740 --> 07:24:14.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Yes, yes. Tama po yun.

asr-008256
07:24:15.180 --> 07:24:16.580
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Pero ito nga.

asr-008257
07:24:17.720 --> 07:24:29.440
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Itong digitalization, kailangan-kailangan po ito para makakuha sila ng mga datas at information sa mga senior citizen na mag-80, 85, 90, 95.

asr-008258
07:24:30.060 --> 07:24:33.440
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: E zero po ang budget nila dito.

asr-008259
07:24:34.080 --> 07:24:41.140
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: At saka yun nga po, yung additional, kailangan talaga kasi kokonti po ang empleyado ng NCSC.

asr-008260
07:24:41.140 --> 07:24:47.220
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So paano naman sila makapag-implement ng mga projects efficiently?

asr-008261
07:24:47.720 --> 07:24:58.880
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kung kokonti naman sa region, 17 regions, regional ang opisina, kokonti pa yung empleyado, paano sila maka-implement?

asr-008262
07:24:58.880 --> 07:25:17.620
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So yan po, humihingi ng additional budget kasi 314 lang yung na-release, e what is 184 million naman na maidagdag sa NCSC para naman po maka-implement sila ng projects efficiently.

asr-008264
07:25:18.440 --> 07:25:23.280
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ma'am, Mr. Chair, it would be a disservice kasi nandito yung DBM representative.

asr-008265
07:25:23.660 --> 07:25:27.660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I think kasi bird's eye view, nandun ho ako from the start till now.

asr-008266
07:25:28.480 --> 07:25:36.200
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So it would be a disservice for me not to advocate kung ano ho yung mga nangyaring usapan ho noon at lalong-lalo na wala dito si Secretary Kim.

asr-008267
07:25:36.320 --> 07:25:37.640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Let me be the one to explain.

asr-008268
07:25:38.600 --> 07:25:42.720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ma'am, hindi ho kailangan ng data because the CBMS has the data already.

asr-008269
07:25:42.720 --> 07:25:42.800
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Okay.

asr-008270
07:25:43.560 --> 07:25:45.680
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yun ho ang ginagamit namin sa 4Ps.

asr-008271
07:25:46.160 --> 07:25:47.720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yun ang ginagamit namin sa social data.

asr-008272
07:25:47.720 --> 07:25:48.080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yun ang ginagamit namin sa pension.

asr-008273
07:25:48.700 --> 07:25:50.840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yun ang ginagamit namin sa lahat ng programa.

asr-008274
07:25:51.460 --> 07:25:52.540
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nandun na ho ang edad.

asr-008275
07:25:52.640 --> 07:25:53.780
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nandun na ho ang address.

asr-008276
07:25:54.200 --> 07:25:56.100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: All we have to do is get the list.

asr-008277
07:25:56.520 --> 07:25:58.260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I-ease filter lang ho natin.

asr-008278
07:25:58.800 --> 07:26:13.620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Then, pagdating ho sa usapin ng contract of service, hindi na ho natin kailan humingi pa ng karagdagan kasi kung lumaki yung subsidies nila o yung MOE nila na naaayon sa kanilang physical targets, may kaakibat na not more than 5% na administrative cost yun.

asr-008279
07:26:13.620 --> 07:26:17.620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So that gives them the leg room to be able to hire more contractors.

asr-008281
07:26:18.700 --> 07:26:28.920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And be able to spend on supplies and all that na para magampanan yung paglapit sa kanilang mga 80, 85, 90, 95 at 100.

asr-008282
07:26:29.240 --> 07:26:33.500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We can really project that ahead of time as far off as 3 years from now.

asr-008283
07:26:34.880 --> 07:26:37.000
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Anong masasabi ninyo, NCSC?

asr-008284
07:26:43.950 --> 07:26:44.430
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Chair?

asr-008285
07:26:45.430 --> 07:26:46.850
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Good afternoon again.

asr-008286
07:26:47.530 --> 07:26:52.490
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: What we're using is data from PSA PhilSys, which is complete.

asr-008287
07:26:52.490 --> 07:26:53.490
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Unlike...

asr-008288
07:26:53.670 --> 07:27:08.190
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Unlike CBMS, there are LGUs that are not included yet in the CBMS because our LGUs who cannot pay for the cost of CBMS cannot be included.

asr-008289
07:27:08.870 --> 07:27:12.110
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: So yun po ang ginagamit namin, PhilSys.

asr-008290
07:27:12.110 --> 07:27:22.450
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: We can do that and we are in talks with PSA PhilSys para they can provide us the data that we need.

asr-008291
07:27:22.790 --> 07:27:23.630
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Except that when...

asr-008292
07:27:23.670 --> 07:27:29.790
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: When we met them, they wanted a court order for them to be able to share their data to the NCSC.

asr-008293
07:27:29.790 --> 07:27:42.130
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: And so, in our meetings with DICT, who is already developing an app for the applications of our senior citizens,

asr-008294
07:27:42.890 --> 07:27:52.790
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: they have advised us to write the Office of the President so that the PhilSys PSA can actually share their data.

asr-008295
07:27:52.790 --> 07:28:08.790
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: To the NCSC so that we can actually project the true number of senior citizens who will be benefiting from the cash gift of the ECA program.

asr-008296
07:28:09.870 --> 07:28:10.190
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Okay.

asr-008297
07:28:10.190 --> 07:28:14.150
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Pero kailangan ma-digitalize kayo ang office ninyo, no?

asr-008298
07:28:14.450 --> 07:28:19.450
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Para it will be more efficient na makagather din kayo ng talaga information.

asr-008299
07:28:19.750 --> 07:28:21.190
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi may...

asr-008305
07:28:22.790 --> 07:28:25.210
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Online registration kayo, di ba?

asr-008306
07:28:25.470 --> 07:28:29.510
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So, kailangan din ninyo talaga na ma-upgrade.

asr-008307
07:28:29.870 --> 07:28:31.550
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Kong Mila, kailangan-kailangan po.

asr-008308
07:28:31.550 --> 07:28:43.950
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Kasi we cannot capture all the data that we need about our senior citizens without, you know, a system that can actually capture these data.

asr-008309
07:28:44.610 --> 07:28:51.430
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Ang ginagamit po namin ngayon na senior citizens online registration is what?

asr-008310
07:28:51.430 --> 07:28:53.910
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Homegrown.

asr-008311
07:28:54.670 --> 07:28:55.530
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Kami-kami lang.

asr-008312
07:28:55.970 --> 07:29:00.830
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Sapagkat wala nga po kaming pondo para pondohan yung system na kailangan namin.

asr-008313
07:29:00.830 --> 07:29:11.970
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: So, for us to be able to be a reliant agency where all the data needed about senior citizens can be derived from, we need that system po.

asr-008314
07:29:12.810 --> 07:29:13.130
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Okay.

asr-008315
07:29:13.710 --> 07:29:21.290
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: At saka ito nga, itong request nyo for vehicles in every region, alam mo na witness ko mismo yan sa Region 1.

asr-008316
07:29:21.290 --> 07:29:27.790
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi daga doon ako, na nag-pay-pay out sila, may daladala silang pera, naka-tricycle sila.

asr-008317
07:29:28.170 --> 07:29:31.630
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So, hindi bali doon, pinapahiram ko yung service namin doon.

asr-008318
07:29:32.050 --> 07:29:33.990
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Pero how about the other regions?

asr-008319
07:29:34.170 --> 07:29:40.570
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So, talagang it is very necessary na meron nga kayong, merong service in every region, mas kisaman lang.

asr-008320
07:29:41.090 --> 07:29:47.750
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: At saka security guard para meron silang kasama pag sila'y nagbabayad ng mga benefits.

asr-008321
07:29:49.050 --> 07:29:50.630
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So, 184.

asr-008322
07:29:51.290 --> 07:29:53.410
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: 184 milyon ang kailangan nyong additional.

asr-008323
07:29:54.670 --> 07:29:59.290
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Yes po, 111 milyon para po sa transportation costs and the...

asr-008324
07:30:00.000 --> 07:30:04.420
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: 20, above 20 million for security services po.

asr-008325
07:30:05.560 --> 07:30:14.620
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So, Mr. Chair, Mr. Chair, yes, ay Madam Chair, andito pala si Mika.

asr-008326
07:30:14.620 --> 07:30:23.000
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Madam Chair, 184 million lang naman ang hinihiling nila na additional para naman po,

asr-008327
07:30:23.000 --> 07:30:30.100
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: para naman maka, maano nga, efficiently they can implement the programs and projects under the NCSC.

asr-008328
07:30:30.700 --> 07:30:38.940
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: No, it's napakaliit naman po yun, para, just to give justice to the 12 million senior citizens, no?

asr-008329
07:30:39.640 --> 07:30:46.560
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: At isa pa pong concern, kasi at saka Negros Island, wala silang, zero, zero ang budget nila.

asr-008330
07:30:46.560 --> 07:30:52.760
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So, madagdagan man lang ng 184, 84,000, 84 million.

asr-008331
07:30:52.760 --> 07:30:57.540
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Para, para mabigyan din ng budget ang ano.

asr-008332
07:30:58.040 --> 07:31:06.180
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Sa kaisa pa, itong LGBTQ office, no, zero po ang, ang budget nila.

asr-008333
07:31:06.440 --> 07:31:12.760
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Bakit naman, parang discrimination naman sa mga LGBTQ na marami naman pong mga senior citizens.

asr-008334
07:31:13.560 --> 07:31:16.160
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Bakit zero ang budget nila?

asr-008335
07:31:17.340 --> 07:31:21.080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ellen has already answered that, but I think she can clarify again.

asr-008336
07:31:22.760 --> 07:31:30.300
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: Actually, I just want to express our, we are grateful po sa our secretary po of the SWD,

asr-008337
07:31:30.380 --> 07:31:38.220
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: kasi sila po yung nag-house sa amin and even provided po our MOOE and also the administrative support po,

asr-008338
07:31:38.280 --> 07:31:40.740
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: as stated po ng Executive Order 51.

asr-008339
07:31:41.060 --> 07:31:47.560
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: So, yeah, kaya po ma'am, mawala rin po kaming budget because of the timing of my appointment,

asr-008340
07:31:47.780 --> 07:31:49.920
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: which is September 29 of last year.

asr-008341
07:31:50.340 --> 07:31:52.640
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: So, when the budget, first budget hearing,

asr-008342
07:31:52.760 --> 07:31:57.640
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: po, was conducted, hindi po kaya kasi I was by myself,

asr-008343
07:31:58.140 --> 07:32:03.460
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: limited po yung staff ko, so hindi po kami nakapag-participate.

asr-008344
07:32:03.640 --> 07:32:08.140
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: It entails a lot of work po and documentations po, so hindi po kami nakaabot.

asr-008345
07:32:08.200 --> 07:32:08.780
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: That's why po.

asr-008346
07:32:09.120 --> 07:32:15.060
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: And also, nung nag-propose na po kami for the another hearing, a budget hearing,

asr-008347
07:32:15.520 --> 07:32:17.840
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: hindi naman po pinayagan ng DBM.

asr-008348
07:32:18.100 --> 07:32:22.580
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: That's why I'm pleading po na sana po mapagbigyan po kami para po naman,

asr-008349
07:32:22.760 --> 07:32:31.280
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: magawa namin yung mandate ng EO 51, which is signed non-other by our President Marcos po.

asr-008350
07:32:31.400 --> 07:32:35.420
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: So, yeah, we want to work na sana according to our mandate.

asr-008351
07:32:36.080 --> 07:32:39.640
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: So, magkakaroon na kayo ng budget?

asr-008352
07:32:40.540 --> 07:32:46.680
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: Yun po yung piniplid po namin, nakikiusap po sana kami na sana po mapagbigyan po kami

asr-008353
07:32:46.680 --> 07:32:52.320
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: so we can function po, our office can really function based po sa mandate, which is policymaking po.

asr-008354
07:32:52.760 --> 07:32:58.080
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: And maliit lang po yung budget na iniling namin, which is 35 million for 2027,

asr-008355
07:32:58.300 --> 07:33:00.700
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: and that is in national scope po yan.

asr-008356
07:33:01.340 --> 07:33:10.660
Undersecretary Ellen Pasion: And meron na rin po kaming plan for 2027 on how to use the budget or utilize the budget appropriately po.

asr-008357
07:33:11.440 --> 07:33:12.580
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Okay, thank you.

asr-008358
07:33:12.680 --> 07:33:16.780
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Sana po we will consider the budget of the LGBTQ.

asr-008359
07:33:17.640 --> 07:33:21.240
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Kasi kailangan din naman maasikaso rin sila eh.

asr-008360
07:33:22.760 --> 07:33:31.760
Rep. Milagros "Mila" Aquino-Magsaysay: Thank you very much, Madam Chair. That's all. Thank you.

asr-008361
07:33:42.140 --> 07:33:44.180
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Thank you, Congresswoman Mila.

asr-008362
07:33:44.960 --> 07:33:52.380
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: I would like to acknowledge the presence here of our Committee Chair for the Appropriations,

asr-008363
07:33:53.380 --> 07:33:56.520
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Chairman, Chairperson Mika Swansing.

asr-008364
07:33:57.320 --> 07:33:59.180
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: I am turning over the...

asr-008365
07:33:59.180 --> 07:34:06.010
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Paul.

asr-008366
07:34:06.170 --> 07:34:07.350
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Vice Chair Ramanava.

asr-008367
07:34:07.670 --> 07:34:10.090
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: First of all, I would like to say thank you.

asr-008368
07:34:10.230 --> 07:34:15.970
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would like to express my gratitude, of course, to Vice Chair Ramanava for his exemplary leadership

asr-008369
07:34:15.970 --> 07:34:21.190
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in managing today's deliberations for BSWD.

asr-008370
07:34:21.570 --> 07:34:24.030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So far po, you started at 9 a.m. po, di ba?

asr-008371
07:34:24.190 --> 07:34:27.510
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So it's already, we're almost close to 8 hours.

asr-008372
07:34:28.850 --> 07:34:29.410
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nagbibidyo.

asr-008373
07:34:29.570 --> 07:34:31.190
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Hindi ba po tayo tapos?

asr-008374
07:34:31.550 --> 07:34:34.030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nagbibidyo na sila po kasi bakit termination na?

asr-008375
07:34:34.470 --> 07:34:36.030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But I just wanted to say,

asr-008376
07:34:36.170 --> 07:34:36.690
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: thank you po.

asr-008377
07:34:36.790 --> 07:34:39.750
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And I would like to thank all the members of the House,

asr-008378
07:34:39.870 --> 07:34:43.030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: our colleagues for your active participation in today's hearings.

asr-008379
07:34:43.370 --> 07:34:46.210
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Of course, I would like to say thank you to the BSWD family.

asr-008380
07:34:46.210 --> 07:34:53.370
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And of course, our, alba, one of the, I would say, best secretaries talaga to work with,

asr-008381
07:34:53.750 --> 07:34:55.370
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Secretary Rex Gachalian.

asr-008382
07:34:56.290 --> 07:34:56.770
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you.

asr-008383
07:34:56.810 --> 07:35:01.210
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much po, Sec, for all of your help in our locality.

asr-008384
07:35:02.250 --> 07:35:04.570
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, siguro po, Sec, before we terminate,

asr-008385
07:35:04.670 --> 07:35:05.210
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would just like to ask...

asr-008386
07:35:06.170 --> 07:35:07.170
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would just like to ask a few questions.

asr-008387
07:35:08.410 --> 07:35:12.710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The first one po, sorry, magsisinita po ako ng parokyal concern.

asr-008388
07:35:12.830 --> 07:35:13.710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Very quick lang po.

asr-008389
07:35:13.710 --> 07:35:15.970
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Last year po, during the deliberations,

asr-008390
07:35:16.090 --> 07:35:20.990
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I raised the concern around the creation of plantilia positions

asr-008391
07:35:20.990 --> 07:35:26.970
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or the regularization of the field workers for the different programs.

asr-008392
07:35:27.350 --> 07:35:29.810
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For peace po, hindi ganun kalaki yung problema

asr-008393
07:35:29.810 --> 07:35:32.850
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because it's a law, it's institutionalized.

asr-008394
07:35:32.950 --> 07:35:36.090
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But for AICs and for the other programs po,

asr-008395
07:35:36.170 --> 07:35:40.290
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: madami po nating mga field workers, mga social workers,

asr-008396
07:35:40.490 --> 07:35:42.930
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay hindi pa social workers kasi hindi pa sila plantilia eh.

asr-008397
07:35:42.930 --> 07:35:47.310
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But we have a lot of field workers who have been working with BSWD

asr-008398
07:35:47.310 --> 07:35:51.950
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for almost close to 10 years and still they are not yet regularized.

asr-008399
07:35:52.230 --> 07:35:57.770
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would advocate for the workers po in our province.

asr-008400
07:35:58.670 --> 07:36:05.050
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: This one I raised po under the leadership of RD Vinos, PD Au,

asr-008401
07:36:06.010 --> 07:36:06.050
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and...

asr-008402
07:36:06.170 --> 07:36:13.710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As of today po, the plantilia positions which I advocated for last year

asr-008403
07:36:13.710 --> 07:36:15.190
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: are still not created po.

asr-008404
07:36:15.330 --> 07:36:18.650
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So it's already been a year, they're still not regularized.

asr-008405
07:36:18.650 --> 07:36:24.490
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So I advocate po ulit, SEC, sana po ma-regularize na sila.

asr-008406
07:36:24.630 --> 07:36:26.510
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Anim lang naman po yata sila o balo.

asr-008407
07:36:27.170 --> 07:36:31.410
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, our apologies, pero konting-konti na lang po na pag-aantay.

asr-008408
07:36:31.610 --> 07:36:35.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I spoke to Secretary Kim around 400...

asr-008409
07:36:36.170 --> 07:36:40.230
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 584 AICS positions are now forthcoming.

asr-008410
07:36:40.530 --> 07:36:41.630
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: These are regular positions.

asr-008411
07:36:41.630 --> 07:36:46.210
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And we'll see to it that those deserving employees na napakatagal na

asr-008412
07:36:46.210 --> 07:36:48.650
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and hard-performing gets to get their dibs on this.

asr-008413
07:36:49.050 --> 07:36:51.630
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang nauna ko kasing lumabas yung 5,000 para sa 4P's.

asr-008414
07:36:52.610 --> 07:36:55.590
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then nasundan ng 16 or 20?

asr-008415
07:36:56.610 --> 07:36:57.130
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 90.

asr-008416
07:36:57.410 --> 07:37:02.390
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 90 sa disaster and then sa social tech around 80 plus.

asr-008417
07:37:02.830 --> 07:37:03.910
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So ito na ho yung next.

asr-008418
07:37:04.130 --> 07:37:05.590
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I was just with him last Friday.

asr-008419
07:37:05.590 --> 07:37:09.030
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And sabi niya, padating na, kumbaga, nandiyan na ho, antay na lang namin.

asr-008420
07:37:09.170 --> 07:37:13.450
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And we will see to it that the employees who deserve will get those plantile positions.

asr-008421
07:37:13.810 --> 07:37:16.050
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Secrex, maungulit ako up until plenary.

asr-008422
07:37:16.410 --> 07:37:18.890
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because it's already been a year since this was raised.

asr-008423
07:37:19.230 --> 07:37:26.410
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I think we saw that even more when we, during our response to the Middle East crisis.

asr-008424
07:37:27.010 --> 07:37:33.490
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Even the fuel and the transport allowance, sila na po talaga yung...

asr-008425
07:37:33.490 --> 07:37:35.030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yeah, bubog sa dati.

asr-008426
07:37:35.030 --> 07:37:36.470
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ...pliners po talaga natin.

asr-008427
07:37:38.130 --> 07:37:39.410
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 24-7 po.

asr-008428
07:37:39.530 --> 07:37:42.150
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Diba, they were working already all over the country.

asr-008429
07:37:42.330 --> 07:37:45.570
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So I'll advocate for them po, Secrex, na sana po magawa.

asr-008430
07:37:45.570 --> 07:37:49.270
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tama-tama, nandito somewhere si Director Ben Gillette ng DBM na may hawk sa amin.

asr-008431
07:37:49.350 --> 07:37:55.850
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: She will make sure, ako na magkocommit, na bibigay niya sa amin yung papel ng regularization ng AICS positions.

asr-008432
07:37:56.130 --> 07:37:56.390
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Apo.

asr-008433
07:37:57.050 --> 07:37:59.030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And I hope po when it's...

asr-008434
07:37:59.630 --> 07:38:03.650
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sana po maramdaman din po all across the country.

asr-008435
07:38:03.650 --> 07:38:04.230
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung creation of the...

asr-008436
07:38:04.230 --> 07:38:04.670
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Unfortunately.

asr-008437
07:38:05.030 --> 07:38:07.750
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Malikit pa lang po yung binigay sa amin, 584.

asr-008438
07:38:07.890 --> 07:38:11.430
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But as Secretary Kim said, it's going to be gradual, tuloy-tuloy naman po.

asr-008439
07:38:11.670 --> 07:38:12.150
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay po.

asr-008440
07:38:12.330 --> 07:38:14.370
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I just want to advocate for them, Secrex.

asr-008441
07:38:14.430 --> 07:38:16.750
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I know you advocate for your people as well.

asr-008442
07:38:16.990 --> 07:38:20.410
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But we'll just put a little bit more pressure on DBM na sabi...

asr-008443
07:38:20.410 --> 07:38:21.650
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sorry po, ata tawagin.

asr-008444
07:38:21.730 --> 07:38:22.490
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: On the spot po na.

asr-008445
07:38:22.550 --> 07:38:23.790
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Si Director Bench ba yan?

asr-008446
07:38:23.950 --> 07:38:24.490
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nandyan, yes.

asr-008447
07:38:24.530 --> 07:38:26.530
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay, Director Bench, are you on the spot?

asr-008448
07:38:26.690 --> 07:38:27.410
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It's been a year.

asr-008449
07:38:31.910 --> 07:38:32.810
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yan, Director.

asr-008450
07:38:32.810 --> 07:38:33.910
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sorry, Director Bench.

asr-008451
07:38:33.910 --> 07:38:34.950
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sorry, you're on the spot.

asr-008452
07:38:35.030 --> 07:38:39.150
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ako na po kasi sila talaga po yung frontliners natin, eh.

asr-008453
07:38:45.370 --> 07:38:46.770
DBM Director IV Benjieleth M. Zuñiga: We'll have to turn on po, Madam Chair.

asr-008454
07:38:47.550 --> 07:38:49.110
DBM Director IV Benjieleth M. Zuñiga: Actually, tama naman po, Secrex.

asr-008455
07:38:49.210 --> 07:38:55.190
DBM Director IV Benjieleth M. Zuñiga: As discussed po with Secretary Kim po nung Friday, for approval na po siya.

asr-008456
07:38:56.190 --> 07:38:58.130
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Actually, ang exact words is, Sec. Kim, di ba?

asr-008457
07:38:58.930 --> 07:39:02.690
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nandyan na, na-approve na, hanapin lang yung papel.

asr-008458
07:39:02.870 --> 07:39:03.770
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero padating na, di ba?

asr-008459
07:39:04.310 --> 07:39:08.530
DBM Director IV Benjieleth M. Zuñiga: For approval na po niya, may question lang po siya doon sa bureau na nag...

asr-008460
07:39:08.530 --> 07:39:08.850
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ano?

asr-008461
07:39:10.530 --> 07:39:16.310
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, I will see to it that I call Sec. Kim to remind him so that we get those positions in

asr-008462
07:39:16.310 --> 07:39:22.350
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: with a priority na yung mga matatagal na humauna, then follow up the next succeeding position.

asr-008463
07:39:22.790 --> 07:39:26.310
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I just want to point out, to be fair with DBM, wala man sila dito.

asr-008464
07:39:26.830 --> 07:39:32.770
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang total na nilabas na nila for 2026 na plantili positions namin is 8,463,

asr-008465
07:39:33.350 --> 07:39:36.810
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: of which 5,000 plus went to 4Ps, at the rest nakakalat.

asr-008466
07:39:36.810 --> 07:39:40.370
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Itong sa AICS lang may clarification, pero I don't think we have...

asr-008467
07:39:40.370 --> 07:39:42.770
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: any disagreement whatsoever.

asr-008468
07:39:43.390 --> 07:39:46.250
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you po, Sec. Director Bench.

asr-008469
07:39:46.610 --> 07:39:48.130
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mahungulit lang po talaga kami.

asr-008470
07:39:48.410 --> 07:39:52.730
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because it's been a year since I spoke about it.

asr-008471
07:39:54.030 --> 07:39:55.810
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Budgeteering po yun ng DSWD.

asr-008472
07:39:56.670 --> 07:40:01.810
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So I'd like to follow up lang po, just to advocate for our frontliners,

asr-008473
07:40:02.450 --> 07:40:04.570
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: our field personnel who are there every day,

asr-008474
07:40:06.110 --> 07:40:10.170
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: disbursing, distributing all of the services that DSWD provides.

asr-008475
07:40:10.370 --> 07:40:17.230
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So alam naman yun ni Secrex talaga how much I've been making kulit about this over the past year.

asr-008476
07:40:17.370 --> 07:40:23.290
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasi po, nakita ko po talaga, iba mag-reddit tayo na lang, hindi pa sila na-regularize.

asr-008477
07:40:23.410 --> 07:40:27.250
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So hopefully po, 400 plus positions po, Secrex, right?

asr-008478
07:40:27.330 --> 07:40:31.750
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That's what we're expecting for 584 positions.

asr-008479
07:40:32.370 --> 07:40:33.370
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yeah, for AICS in particular.

asr-008480
07:40:33.370 --> 07:40:36.810
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay. 4Ps done na po. End disaster.

asr-008481
07:40:36.910 --> 07:40:40.370
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: First batch po, 5,000 na po yun. May buntot pa ulit na another 5,000.

asr-008482
07:40:40.450 --> 07:40:43.330
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Apo. Sige po, Secrex. We'll work together po.

asr-008483
07:40:43.810 --> 07:40:50.630
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll, mag-ulit po tayo sa DBM to advocate for our frontliners.

asr-008484
07:40:50.970 --> 07:40:52.370
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Secrex.

asr-008485
07:40:52.630 --> 07:41:01.370
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I'll move lang po to, there's a, one of our initiatives in the Committee on Appropriations

asr-008486
07:41:01.370 --> 07:41:06.750
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: is to put forth some of the questions of the civil society organizations.

asr-008487
07:41:06.750 --> 07:41:10.350
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And this morning po, Senior Vice Chair,

asr-008488
07:41:10.450 --> 07:41:14.810
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Abbot Garcia, and several of our vice chairpersons in the Committee on Appropriations

asr-008489
07:41:14.810 --> 07:41:16.610
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: conducted the People's Budget Review.

asr-008490
07:41:16.830 --> 07:41:22.730
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So mayroon na pong engagement sa civil society organizations as to what insights they have

asr-008491
07:41:22.730 --> 07:41:27.230
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: with regard to particular agencies, particular budget items, and the like.

asr-008492
07:41:27.230 --> 07:41:37.090
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And similarly po, we also committed to them that we will propound questions on their behalf to the agency.

asr-008493
07:41:37.330 --> 07:41:39.650
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So I have here a few.

asr-008494
07:41:39.650 --> 07:41:41.650
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: A few of the questions.

asr-008495
07:41:41.830 --> 07:41:47.370
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And if you would allow me po, Secrex, I'd just like to ask some of their questions po.

asr-008496
07:41:47.610 --> 07:41:52.490
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The first would be from Enet with regard to early childhood care and development.

asr-008497
07:41:52.850 --> 07:41:55.730
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I believe this was tackled earlier today as well.

asr-008498
07:41:56.470 --> 07:42:01.270
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Particularly with regard to the supplementary feeding program of the SWD.

asr-008499
07:42:01.270 --> 07:42:09.270
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The question is, DSWD's supplementary feeding declined from 9.564 billion

asr-008500
07:42:09.650 --> 07:42:16.710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in fiscal year 2026 to 6.359 billion in 2027 in the NEP,

asr-008501
07:42:16.970 --> 07:42:24.910
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: while the target remains 1,899,415 children in CDCs and SNPs.

asr-008502
07:42:25.430 --> 07:42:29.910
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Question po, how will the SWD maintain the same beneficiary target

asr-008503
07:42:29.910 --> 07:42:33.430
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: with roughly 3.2 billion less in funding?

asr-008504
07:42:33.830 --> 07:42:35.890
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: If you can recall, Madam Chair,

asr-008505
07:42:36.350 --> 07:42:38.690
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: dinagdagan yung number of days kaya lumaki ho yan eh.

asr-008506
07:42:38.770 --> 07:42:39.630
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: To synchronize with the target.

asr-008507
07:42:39.630 --> 07:42:42.250
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: To synchronize with the DepEd from 120 to 180 days.

asr-008508
07:42:42.750 --> 07:42:44.430
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So binalik lang ho sa 120.

asr-008509
07:42:44.890 --> 07:42:47.670
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So meaning, same number of beneficiaries, lesser number of days.

asr-008510
07:42:48.130 --> 07:42:49.630
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But we put it in our...

asr-008511
07:42:50.610 --> 07:42:51.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nilagay natin, no?

asr-008512
07:42:52.370 --> 07:42:56.970
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But again, we will respect the wisdom of Congress

asr-008513
07:42:56.970 --> 07:43:00.510
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: if you wish to synchronize it back to 180

asr-008514
07:43:00.510 --> 07:43:02.810
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para tugmang-tugma kami with DepEd.

asr-008515
07:43:03.610 --> 07:43:04.950
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Secrex.

asr-008516
07:43:04.950 --> 07:43:08.950
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Actually, that was one of the concerns that was raised by SecSun

asr-008517
07:43:09.630 --> 07:43:10.250
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: yesterday.

asr-008518
07:43:10.570 --> 07:43:12.630
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It's really the cut from...

asr-008519
07:43:13.450 --> 07:43:16.610
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The difference essentially from the 2026 GA-A level

asr-008520
07:43:16.610 --> 07:43:20.610
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of roughly 26 billion for the school-based feeding program

asr-008521
07:43:20.610 --> 07:43:25.770
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: down back to the 2026 NEP level of 11 billion.

asr-008522
07:43:26.090 --> 07:43:29.710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So that was one of the discussions yesterday po.

asr-008523
07:43:29.750 --> 07:43:33.610
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It will take that into consideration as we look through the budget.

asr-008524
07:43:34.490 --> 07:43:36.390
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero given the limited fiscal space po,

asr-008525
07:43:36.470 --> 07:43:39.170
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we'll do the best that we can.

asr-008526
07:43:39.630 --> 07:43:42.810
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: They were just asking po, Secrex, as a follow-up question,

asr-008527
07:43:43.270 --> 07:43:46.650
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: what meal cost, number of feeding days, and nutritional standards

asr-008528
07:43:46.650 --> 07:43:49.990
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: are assumed under the 6.359 billion allocation?

asr-008529
07:43:50.390 --> 07:43:53.050
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're still at the 25 pesos per meal cap,

asr-008530
07:43:53.310 --> 07:43:56.490
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: which is an increase when we joined this administration.

asr-008531
07:43:56.690 --> 07:43:59.730
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: It was only at maliit lang ngayon, 18 pesos.

asr-008532
07:43:59.910 --> 07:44:01.230
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So we're now at 25 pesos.

asr-008533
07:44:01.230 --> 07:44:05.610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then milk for the undernourished is at 22 pesos,

asr-008534
07:44:05.790 --> 07:44:08.490
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: which we get from the Carabao Center.

asr-008535
07:44:09.630 --> 07:44:12.030
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then 120 days, as mentioned.

asr-008536
07:44:12.730 --> 07:44:19.410
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then the caloric intake is based on the FNRI-approved Pinggang Pinoy.

asr-008537
07:44:20.230 --> 07:44:21.530
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Secrex.

asr-008538
07:44:21.670 --> 07:44:26.750
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And finally po, will any part of the cost be shifted to LGUs, parents, or other sources?

asr-008539
07:44:26.750 --> 07:44:31.510
