asr-008540
07:44:31.710 --> 07:44:33.570
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Again, it's based on enrollment.

asr-008541
07:44:34.230 --> 07:44:38.190
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Once they enter the number of children enrolled in their IS system,

asr-008542
07:44:38.670 --> 07:44:39.590
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: dun lang naman namin hinipin.

asr-008543
07:44:39.630 --> 07:44:42.090
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So the more enrollment, the more you get.

asr-008544
07:44:42.570 --> 07:44:44.550
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Obviously, it's an efficient way of doing it.

asr-008545
07:44:44.650 --> 07:44:46.370
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kesa kung mag-a-allocate kami ng fix,

asr-008546
07:44:46.530 --> 07:44:50.910
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pero hindi naman nila natatamaan yung bilang ng studyante na nag-e-enroll.

asr-008547
