DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But on a separate note,

asr-008548
07:44:53.530 --> 07:44:57.150
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: if they mean kung ipapass on namin yung cost sa iba, hindi po.

asr-008549
07:44:57.590 --> 07:44:58.850
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero ang nangyayari ngayon,

asr-008550
07:44:59.230 --> 07:45:00.240
