asr-008558
07:45:14.100 --> 07:45:16.220
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: para diretso ho in procurement sa ating

asr-008559
07:45:16.220 --> 07:45:18.180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: mga magsasaka. So, as much

asr-008560
07:45:18.180 --> 07:45:20.000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: as we can, we empower the local government units

asr-008561
07:45:20.000 --> 07:45:22.040
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi they're the ones providing the

asr-008562
07:45:22.040 --> 07:45:24.140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: teachers anyway. And from our

asr-008563
07:45:24.140 --> 07:45:26.460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: experience, LGUs

asr-008564
07:45:26.460 --> 07:45:27.860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: also augment.

asr-008565
07:45:27.860 --> 07:45:29.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi hindi naman ho sapat

asr-008566
07:45:29.700 --> 07:45:32.120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: minsan sa maraming LGUs, nagdadagdag pa

asr-008567
07:45:32.120 --> 07:45:33.660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ng bilang

asr-008568
07:45:33.660 --> 07:45:35.580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: or ng number para

asr-008569
07:45:35.580 --> 07:45:36.780
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: tumaas yung unit cost.

